<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Maatoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Maatoosa Xaafide Yesuus kiristtoosa Wonggele</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maatoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Maato.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maatoosa Xaafide</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggele</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Maatoosa Wonggele, yo7odes ga7intti ufayssara naaginttize ashshize Yesuusa maaqqizannon Xoozze gal77a caaqo fa asuntsis inggide ufays qaala folide E baggara maaqqidanno ohize Wonggele. Hyay Wonggelize Yesuusa un gidda yelintti diccide Ayhuduntsis xalaalas maaqqikaayzin kumutsi alame ubbannis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maatoosa Wonggele, gaama naaginttera xaafinttide maxaafe. Maatoosa fa maxaafito Yesuusa yelinttippa dentsii, E Xammaqintton E fattaninttidanno ohi maaqqii, Galila E sabbakide bazin, tamaarssidannon hyargganchchuntsana fatstside baz ohine. Yinnippa kaallii, Yesuusa Galilappa Yerusalaame hyanggidannon E hyanna sa7ite yeze wode wurssutsi saamintte hyanide baz qonccizane. Yinnan E suxintton, E hyayqiton E denddito aykkida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hyay Wonggelize, Yesuusa Xoozze higge billodes adetits wolqqa yezayan Xoozze ka7itumo baz tamaarssize damma asttamaare mahi shiishane. E timirttitippa gaama bagita dumma dumma wogara giiginttide ichchin bessa shaginttida.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Xoozze ka7itumo yeze as hyanotitsi, oocha, adetits wolqqan wurssutsi ixa ohize Derella afa Timirtte (Zofa 5-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Taphpho lam77i tamaaruntsi Wonggele sabbakodes qitize wode unttis ingginttide woga (Zofa 10).</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Xoozze ka7itumo baz tamaarssodes shiiqide dumma dumma aazizto (Zofa 13).</para>
  <para style="ip">4. E tamaare maaqqize baz billii ohize timirtte (Zofa 18).</para>
  <para style="ip">5. Hyatte alamtti wurssutsite Xoozze ka7itumo ye7e baz ohize timirtte (Zofa 24-25).</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuus Kiristtoosa yelintte xussan E yelintto <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-2:23">1:1—2:23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqize Wahannisa oochito <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa xinqqatton fattanintto <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">3:13—4:11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa Galila fa oochito aykkidanno <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 4:12-18:35">4:12—18:35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galilappa Yerusalaame yellodes <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 19:1-20:34">19:1—20:34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssutsi saamintta Yerusalaame guta <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-27:66">21:1—27:66</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Laatstse hyayqoppa dendditon qonccitsito <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-20">28:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa yelintte xussii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luqa. 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Yinnippa kaallii xaafinttide Dawute na7a Abrahama na7a maaqqide Yesuus Kiristtoosa yelintto.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abrahama Yisaaqa yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Yisaaqa Yayqooba yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Yayqooba Yihudan E ishuntsana yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yihuda Ti7imarippa Faaresenen Zaaran yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Faaresa Asroome yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Asroome Raame yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Raame Aminaadabe yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminaadabe Na7asoona yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Na7asoona Salmoone yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salmoone Re7aabippa Boo7eza yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Boo7eza Uruutippa Iyobeede yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Iyobeede Issey yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Isseyen kaati Dawute yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:6">Dawute Ooriyo machchitippa Solomone yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Solomone Robi7aama yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Robi7aama Abiya yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Abiye Asaafa yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asaappa Iyosaafixe yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Iyosaafixe Iyoraame yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Iyoraame Ooziyane yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Ooziyane Iyo7ataama yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Iyo7ataama Akkaza yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Akkaza Hiziqiyasa yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hiziqiyasa Minaase yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Minaase Amoona yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Amoona Iyosiyaasa yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Isra7eele asuntsi di7intti Baabiloone gaaze sa7a hyanggide wode Iyosiyaasa Ikoniyaanan E ishuntsana yelida.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Baabiloone sa7a Isra7eele asuntsi di7inttii hyanggideppa maaqqii Ikoniyaana Salatiyaale yelida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-15">2 Kat. 24:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Zeena 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:20">Er. 27:20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:12">Salatiyaale Zerubaabela yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zerubaabela Abdiyu yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Abdiyu Eliyaaqeme yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliyaaqeme Azaara yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azaara Sadooqe yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Sadooqe Akime yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akime Eliyuuda yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliyuuda Alaazare yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Alaazare Maatane yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Maatane Yayqooba yelida;<verse eid="MAT 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yayqooba Yoosefa yelida;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:16">Yoosefa Kiristtoosa gaaze Yesuusa yelide Mayrami azini.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Yikke, yelintta Abrahameppa Dawute yellodes taphpho oyddii. Dawuteppa hyanggi Baabiloone di7e yellodes taphpho oyddii. Baabiloone di7eppa hyanggi Kiristtoosa yellodes taphpho oyddii yelintte maaqqane.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuus Kiristtoosa yelintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luqa. 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa yelintta taarike hyannippa kaallizanno. E intta Mayrama Yoosefas oocintti yezite Yoosefa ekkikaayzin Geeshi Ayyaanappa wodaxida. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Yoosefa xillo as maaqqide gisho izo as gidda kessodes koykaaya. Yinnii gisho aachchii izo ashshodes qoppida. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>E yinna qofite yezin Xoozze kiitanchcho abukkora qonccii, «Dawute na7ay, Yoosefa, ne oocide Mayrama wodaxide Geeshi Ayyaanappa maaqqide gisho izo ekkodes zhashtippe» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Iza dhiiratsi na7a yeloda, E fa worzhito un nagarttippa ashshize gisho E suntsito ne Yesuusa ga7i xeegoda.<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Laatstse nabe Isayaasa doona. <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>«Yikke wudurtta wodaxoda; dhiiratsi na7an yeloda; E suntsita Ammanu7eela ga7inttoda» ga7inttidanna folinttode fana hyanna ubbanna hyanida. Ammanu7eela gaazannis bilitsita «Xoozii nuura yene» ga7e.<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Yoosefa genttoppa barkki Laatstse kiitanchchuntsi kiittidanni fana Mayramo fa kara kanggida. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Yezin fa anggis na7aya yelode wontsis izo girmmikaaya;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Izo girmmikaaya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Machchira azinara wolla aqizanni fana aqikaaya ga7e.</char></note> Yelinttide na7aya Yesuusa ga7i xeegida.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Awa kessappa yi7ide asuntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Kaat Heroodosa wode Yesuusa Yihuda sa7a Beetaleme katama yelinttidannippa suuba xoolintto bi7i asuntsi awa kessappa Yerusalaame yi7i, <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>«Yelinttide Ayhude kaatize aba yene? Nuunii awa kessi zalara kezii E xoolinttiza bi7i eesi goynodes yi7ida» Yaga7i oocida. <verse eid="MAT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Kaati Heroodosa yinno si7ide wode tannida. Yerusalaame yeze asuntsi ubbanna tannida. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Heroodosa kahinunts hyalaquntsanan higge asttamaaruntsana faago xeegii, «Kiristtoosa aba yelinttessa?» yaga7i unttana oocida.<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Unttin, Yihuda Beeteleme; nabize,<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>« ‹Yihuda yeze Beetaleme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">Yihuda yeze damma Katamuntsappa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">neenii akkon eroos.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">Ta worzhito Isra7eele ahoday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">neeppa kezoda› ga7i xaafida» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik. 5:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 2:6">yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Yinnippa suuba, Heroodosa awa kessappa yi7ide asuntsana aachchii xeegii, xoolinttiza un bi7ide wode unttappa loytsii erida. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>E unttana Beetaleme dakkitera, «Hyanggi yelinttide na7aya mintsii koyote; eza yin denggide wode taanin hyanggi eesi goynode gaar maaqqii yi7itera taas ohote» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Unttin Kaat Heroodosa gaydanno si7i hyanggida. Un awa kessi zalara hyanggi xoolinttize unttana kaalitsitera na7ay yeze besito yellodes kanggida. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Un ye xoolinttiza bi7ide wode damma ufays ufayttida. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Keetstsa gelii na7ay fa inttii Mayramira yezaya bi7ida. Eesi bunqqunttii goynida. Fa saaxintto bugii worqqan, ixaanen karbbe eesi shiishida. <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Un Heroodosago suub maaqqaame fana Xoozii abukkora unttis ohin, melle ogera fa gade maaqqida.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gibxxe bete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Awa kessi zalara yi7ide asuntsi qitidannippa suuba, Laatstse kiitanchchize Yoosefas abukkora qonccii, «Heroodosa na7aya wodhodes koyze gisho denddii; ellisii na7ayan na7ay intton ekkii Gibxxe gade qito. Ne maaqqade wode ta nees ohode wontsis yeyga gam77o» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Yinnii gisho, Yoosefa yinna qammite denddii, na7ayan na7a intto ekkii Gibxxe qitida. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Nabe doontte Xoozii, «Taanii, ta na7aya, Gibxxe gadeppa xeegida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hose. 11:1</ref></char></note>ga7inttide qaaltta folinttode gaar Heroodosa hyayqqode wontsis E yeyga yezida.<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Yinnippa suuba, awa Kessi zalara yi7ide asuntsi eza cimmidanno eride wode gaama zhilidhdhida. E tiino unttappa si7idanni fana Beetelemen yinna gutute yeze lam77i bere kumiduntsanan lam77i bereppa yeekkara yeze dhiiratsi na7untsana ubba fa wottaddaruntsana dakkii wodhizida.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17-18"/>Nabe Ermmiyasa doontte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:17-18">«Yeefon yeefo dentse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:17-18">Raama katama sinttida.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:17-18">Raahela fa na7untsis yeekkane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:17-18">un hyayqqide gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:17-18">minggodes dandda7ikaaya»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 2:17-18">ga7i ohinttidanna folinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Er. 31:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:17-18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Naazirete maaqqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Heroodosa hyayqqidanippa suuba Gibxxe Laatstse kiitanchcho Yoosefas abukkora qonccii, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>«Na7aya wodhodes koyze asuntsi hyayqqide gisho denddii na7ayan na7ay intto ekkii Isra7eele gade maaqqo» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Yoosefa denddii na7ayan na7ay intto ekkii Isra7eele gade maaqqida. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Yezin Arkkeliyoosa Yihuda fa ade Heroodisa besite ka7itidanno si7ide wode yeyga hyanggodes zhashtida. Xoozii abukkora eesi qonccizin Galila gade qitida. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Nabunts doontte, «Naazirete asi ga7inttoda» yaga7i ohinttidanna folinttode fana Naazirete katama hyanggi yeyga yezida.<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqize Wahannisa timirttito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-17">Luqa. 3:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Waha. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1-2"/>Ye wode Xammaqize Wahannisa, «Xoozze ka7itumo ukkide gisho yin nagarappa maaqqote» yaga7i sabbakitera Yihuda akko baayze ganasa qitida. <verse eid="MAT 3:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Nabe Isayaasa Wahannisa baz ohidanni fana,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Maato. 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mar. 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Akko baayze ganasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">fetay fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">‹Laatstse ogito giigizote.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">E worogito luulizote› gayda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 3:3">yaga7inttidanna eesi yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Wahannisa gimale isintseppa oochinttide afula ma77ane. Fa qazintten dafe saqqe danccane. E mu7ize katsitan boolen dekera shida. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Asuntsi ye wode Yerusalaame katamappa, Yihuda sa7a ubbappa Yorddaanosa borkka kaleppa eego ye7ine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Kat. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Fa nagartto buuxi Yorddaanosa borkka Wahannisa kushe xammaqinttida.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Wahannisa, gaama Farisaawuntsin saduqaawuntsi xammaqinttodes faago yi7izuntsana bi7i, unttago, «Hyantsi iita shooshuntso, yo7ode Xoozze kachchappa attode fana yinttana oode zoride? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Yikke, Yin, yin nagarttippa maaqqidanno beezze oocha oochchote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Maato. 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Yin, yin wozintte, ‹Abrahama, nu aday yene› yaga7i qoppipete. Loytsii si7ote! Xoozii hyanna shuchchitippa Abrahamas na7a kessodes dandda7ane. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Gandde minxiti xaphite giigii yene; lo77o aafe aafoosse minxa ubba gachchii tama olinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Waha. 8:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>«Yin, yin nagarttippa maaqqidanno ersodes ta yinttana hyaatsa xammaqane. Yezin taappa suubara ye7ize yinttana Geeshi ayyaanaran tamara xammaqoda. E taappa gaama wolqqara yene; ta melle atto yezin E caammito tukkodesin beezoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Maato. 7:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Katstsa geeshize fitsita E kushite yene. Katsito loytsii geeshane; zargito fa fachite gussoda, yezin fugito dhaboosse tama michchoda» yagayda. <figure style="fig" alt="Winnowing grain with winnowing fork" file="HK00097B.TIF" size="span" ref="3:12">Katstsa geeshize fixize E kushite yene</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa xammaqintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar. 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luqa. 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Ye wode Yesuusa Wahannisa kushe xammaqinttodes Galilappa Yorddaanosa borkka hyanggida. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Yezin Wahannisa eza kayodes koyi «Taanii neera xammaqinttodes beezzin ne taago ye7ine?» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Yezin Yesuusa mahi, «Xoozii nuuppa koyze baz ubba nu folodes beezze gisho hyatte taas ero ga7o» yagayda. Wahannisa ees yee7e yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Yesuusa xammaqinttide fana hyaatsitippa kezida. Iira salo bugunttin Xoozze Ayyaana wolle fana ye7oderan mahi faalla afa wodhdhodera bi7ida. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Ye wode «Hyaychche ta kadhize, E tana ufaysize ta na7ay hyaya» yagaaze qaala saloppa yi7ida.<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fattanintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar. 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luqa. 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Yinnippa suuba, Xalahe Yesuusa fattanode gaar Geeshi Ayyaana Yesuusa akko baayze ganasa kanggida. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Oyttam qamman oyttam awara xoomidannippa suuba naydhdhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:18">Ibr. 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:2">4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Xalahe Yesuusago yi7i «Ne Xooz na7a maaqqiko, ane hyay shuchchiza soollo maaqqade fana kiitto» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Yesuusa mahi, « ‹Asi Xoozze doonappa kezze qaala ubbanne yessadep attin soollo xalaalara yezoos› ga7intti Xoozze qaaltte xaafinttida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:4">Maato. 4:4</ref></char></note>yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Mahin, Xalahe Yesuusa geeshi katama kanggi, Xoozze keetsitis ommite kessii, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>«Ne Xooz na7a maaqqiko, ane sulle sa7a gol7o. Akkos gayko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:11">Maz. 91:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>« ‹Ne tohita shuchchalla dhubunttaame fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">fa kushtira nena dentsode fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">Xoozii fa kiitanchchuntsana ne gisho kiittoda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 4:6">ga7intti Xoozze qaaltte xaafinttida» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesuusa eego, «mahi, ‹Xoozze qaaltte ne Laatstsa, ne Xoozza fatanippe› yaga7i xaafinttida» ga7i mahida.<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Wurssutsite Xalahe Yesuusa fettii damma dere omma kessii alame ka7itumo un bonchchtira fettilla beezii,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Mahe 8:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>«Ne taas gol7i goyniko ta nees hyanno ubba inggoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Hyay Xalahizayo, taappa hyaakko! ‹Ne Laatstsa, ne Xoozza goyno, E xalaalas kiitintto› gayntti Xoozze qaaltte xaafinttida» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Yinnippa suuba, Xalahe ashshii qitida; kiitanchchuntsi yi7i eza maaddida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Mahe 6:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa timirttito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar. 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luqa. 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Yesuusa, Wahannisa acinttidanno si7ide wode Galila gade qitida. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Naazirete katama ashshii Zaabiloonen Niftaaleme guta, abba kale yeze Qifirnahoome katama hyanggi yeyga yezida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Maato. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar. 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luqa. 3:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Yinna hyanidanna nabe Isayaasa doontte,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:12">Waha. 2:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>«Zaabiloone gaden, Niftaaleme gade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Yorddaanosa borkkappa seko fintsa abba oge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Ayhude maaqqoosse worzhuntsis yeze Galila,<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>dhuma yeze worzha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">damma foo7o bi7ida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">Hyayqo dasho gade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">yezuntsis foo7o kezida» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Isa. 9:1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 4:16">yaga7i ohinttide qaaltta folinttode fana.<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Ye wodeppa dentsii Yesuusa, «Xooz ka7itumo ukkide gisho yin nagarttippa maaqqote» yaga7i qaala sabbakida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Maato. 3:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiino tamaaruntsi xeegintte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16">Luqa. 4:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Yesuusa Galila Abba kalera aadhitera lam77i ishuntsana, Phexiroosa ga7inttize Simoonan E isha Inddirase bi7ida. Un molo aykkizuntsana maaqqide gisho fa gitito abballa olida. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesuusa unttana, «Hyankka yo7ote; tana kaallote! Molo aykkizanno ashshii, ta yinttana as ayfo tamaarssoda» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Un, ellisii fa gitito olii ashshii Yesuusa kaallida.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Yesuusa yeygappa hyaga gode tiino aadhitera melle lam77i ishuntsana, Zabdiyoosa na7untsana, Yayqooban Wahannisan bi7ida. Fa aday Zabdiyoosara wolla gongge gidda fa gitito loytsizuntsana xeegida. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Un, ellisii fa gonggiton fa adayan ashshii Yesuusa kaallida.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hyargginttizuntsana fatstsida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luqa. 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesuusa Ayhude woosa keetstsa tamaarssitera, salo ka7itumo Wonggele ohitera dumma dumma hyarggeppa asuntsana fatstsitera Galila sa7a ubbanne wutida.<verse eid="MAT 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Yinnippa denddii E suntsita Sooriya gade ubba erinttida. Dumma dumma hyarggera aykinttiduntsanan waayinttizuntsana, tuna ayyaanara aykinttiduntsana, biicora yezuntsana, wobbuntsana eego ki7ida; ezin unttana fatstsida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:35">Maato. 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar. 1:39</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Asuntsi Galilappa, taphphi katamuntsappa, Yerusalaameppa, Yihudappan Yorddaanosa borkka seko fintsa yeze gadeppa yi7ide gaama asuntsi eza kaallida.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa derella afa tamaarsside timirtte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Gaama worzha shiiqidanno Yesuusa bi7i derella afa kezii bettida. E tamaaruntsi eego shiiqin, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Hyannii gaar yaga7i tamaarssida:<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Turii ufayssi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:2-23">Luqa. 6:2-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>«Fa ayyaantte daha maaqqiduntsi anjjinttiduntsana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">salo ka7itumo unttis.<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Yeekizuntsi anjjinttiduntsana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">un mintsitse denggoda.<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Wozina aaduntsi anjjinttiduntsana,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:2">Isa. 61:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">un sa7a laattoda.<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Xillotitsi oochchodes naydhdhizuntsin bardhdhizuntsi anjjinttiduntsana,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:11">Maz. 37:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">un mishshada.<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Maarizuntsi anjjinttiduntsana,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa. 55:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">un maarotitsi denggoda.<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Wozina geeshshuntsi anjjinttiduntsana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">un Xoozii be7ada.<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Giigizuntsi anjjinttiduntsana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">un Xooz na7a ga7intti xeeginttoda. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:3">Maz. 24:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Xillotitsi oochchize gisho ga7i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">bay7inttizuntsi anjjinttiduntsana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">salo ka7itumo unttis.<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>«Asuntsi yinttana ta gisho ga7i cazhize wode bay7ize woden yinttalla afa iita baz ubba worddora ohize wode yin anjjinttiduntsana. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14">1 Phex. 3:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Yin anjjita salo damma maaqqide gisho ufayttote, loytsii ufayttote. Yinttappa tiino yezide nabuntsana yinnii gaar bay7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Phex. 4:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Soogen foo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>«Yin sa7as sooge; sooge fa mal77itumtto ashshiko, wayzi mahi denggode? Bale dhogiko asara yedhinttanep attin akkosin maaddoos.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>«Yin sa7as foo7o; derella afa yeze katamita aachinttodes dandda7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar. 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luqa. 14:34-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Xomppe aytsii keetstsa yeze asuntsi ubbuntsis foo7ode gaar dhoqqa bessa gaddanep attin gabate gidda gaddize baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Waha. 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Yinnii gaar asuntsi yin lo77o oochito bi7i, salo yeze yin adaya bonchchode gaar yin foo7ita as tiino foo7o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1 Phex. 2:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muse higge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>«Taanii Muse higgiton nabunts qaala shaarodes yi7ida yinttis aazippe. Taanii, un ohidanna turo maaqqidanno qonccissades yi7idap attin shaarodes yi7ikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Ta yinttis turo ohine; salon sa7a aadhode wontsis higge ubba folinttodep attin higgitifa fettii qaala woy fidaale aadhoos. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Yinnii gisho, hyanna kiititippa eerize fettii kiitan mentsize ooden mahi melluntsana yinnii gaar oochchode gaar tamaarssize ooden salo ka7itumo ubbuntsappa eeratsi maaqqada. Yezin hyanna kiitto folizen melluntsanan folode gaar tamaarssize salo ka7itumo damma maaqqada. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Ta yinttis ohine; yin xillotitsita Farisaawunts xillotitsappan higge asttamaarunts xillotitsappa aadhanxiko, salo ka7itumo geloos.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wodhe baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>«Yin mayzuntsis, ‹Wodhippete; shemppo wodhide ooden firdinttoda› ga7inttidanno si7ida. <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Yezin ta yinttis ohine; fa ishaya cazhize ooden firdinttoda. Fa ishaya cazhize ooden daynna tiino firddas shiiqoda. Fa ishego, ‹Eeyay› gaaze ooden mahi gaanname tamite firdinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Keze 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Mahe 5:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>«Yinnii gisho, ne ne zharsho zharshize wode ne ishaya qohide baz nees tiirnttiko, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>Ne zharshito iza besite ashshii ashshii qito; tiino hyanggi ne ishayra giigo; yeyzi maaqqii, ne zharshito Xoozis zharsho.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>«Nena mootizera firdda keetstsa hyanggitera ogella eera giigo. Yinna atto gayko E nena daynna tiino kanggoda. Daynnize nena accizes aatsii inggoda; E nena woyne oloda. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Ta turo ohine; neella afa firddinttide acito fettii santtime attikaayzin ciggii hyaasode wontsis achi keetstsappa mulon kezaama.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olale baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>«Hyannippa zaga, ‹Olale hyanttippete› ga7inttidanno si7ida. <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Yezin ta yinttis ohine, maacho bi7i, amudhdhide ubba fa wozintte iira olalida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Keze 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Mahe 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Ne mizaqi aafize nees nagaras mikinaate maaqqiko, kessii olo. Ne galtta kumutsita gaanname tama wodhdhodannippa ne gallitippa fetay dhabiko nees lo77o. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Ne mizaqi kushize nees nagaras mikinaate maaqqiko, eza gachchii olo. Ne galtta kumutsita gaanname tama wodhdhodannippa ne gallitippa fetay dhabiko, nees lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Maato. 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mar. 9:43</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Machchin azini bilintte baz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Maato. 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luqa. 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>«‹Fa machchito dakkize ooden dafo warqqate inggo› ga7inttida. <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Yezin ta yinttis ohine; fa machchito olalikaayzin billize ooden iza olalode gaar oochchane. Yinnii gaaran, dakinttide machchito ekkize ubba olalida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:9">Maato. 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luqa. 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Qoro. 7:10-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Caaqo baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>«Yin mayzuntsago, ‹Worddo caaqqippete; yin Xoozze tiino caaqqidanno folote› ga7inttidanno si7ida. <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Yezin ta yinttis ohine; mulon caaqqippete. Xoozii bettize oyda maaqqide gisho salora caaqqippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Leewe 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Faydo 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Mahe 23:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>E tohita yedhdhize bessi maaqqide gisho sa7ara caaqqippete. Damma kaat katama maaqqide gisho Yerusaalaameran caaqippete. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Yin ommitippa fetaya bootsi woy kartsi mahodes dandda7oosse gisho yin yin ommite caaqqippete. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Yinnii gisho, yin qaaltta, ‹Yee› woy ‹Ade› maaqqo. Yinnippa bale kezize xalaheppa ye7ine.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qime ayppades beezoos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>« ‹Aafe gisho aafe; achchi gisho achchi› ga7inttidanno si7ida. <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Yezin ta yinttis ohine; yinttalla afa iita baz oochchize atstsa ixxippete. Ooden ne mizaqi dhookiza baqqiko ne workkita dhookizan beezo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Fettii asi ne shaamiza wolqqara ekkodes nena mootiko, ne kootizan gujjii inggo. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Fettii asi nena wolqqara fa baz toossii fettii saate oge faara hyanggode gaar nena un7itsiko, eera lam77i saate oge hyanggo. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Woossize oodesin inggo; neeppa tal77odes koyko oonan kayippe.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ne morkkuntsana siiqo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-36">Luqa. 6:27-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>«‹Nena kadhiza kadho; nena ixxizaya ixxo› ga7inttidanno si7ida. <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Yezin ta yinttis ohine; yin morkkuntsana kadhote; yinttana qohizuntsis woossote. <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>Yinnii gaar yin oochchiko, salo yeze yin adays yin na7untsana maaqqada. E iituntsisin lo77untsis awa kassane; xilluntsisin nagaranchchuntsisin fa ira bukkizane. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Yinttana kadhize asuntsana xalaala yin kadhiko, yinttis akko tirfe yeze? Melle atto yezin, gabe qaraxe gachchizuntsin yinno oochchane. <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Yin, yin ishuntsana xalaala saritsiko, melluntsappa akko aadhizebaz oochchidote? Melle atto yezin, Xooz ammanoose asuntsi yinno oochchane. <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Yikke, salo yeze yin aday folo maaqqidanni fana yinttin folo maaqqote.<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Ingge baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>«Asi bo7o ga7i yin lo77o oochito as tiino oochaame fana naaginttote. Yinnii gaar yi7anxiko salo yeze yin adayppa anjjo denggaama.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>«Yin dahuntsis inggize wode as tiino bonchchinttodes ga7i cubbuntsi oge gaxan Ayhude woosa keetstsan oochchizanni fana asi bo7o ga7i oochippete. Ta yinttis turo ohine un fa kumutsi anjjito ekkida<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:5">Maato. 23:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Yezin yin dahuntsis inggize wode yin mizaqi kushe oochchizanno yin workkita kushe erippe; <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>yin imotta geema maaqqe. Geema bessa oochchizanno be7ize yin aday yinttis anjjito qoncce inggoda.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woosa baz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luqa. 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>«Woosa woossittera cubbuntsi gaar yiippete. Un, fana asi bo7o ga7i Ayhude woosa keetstsa oge doontte eqqii woossizanno kadhane. Ta yinttis turo ohine; un fa kumutsi anjjito ekkida. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Yezin ne woossize wode ne qol7a gelo, furtsito gorddii geema yeze ne adaya woosso; geema oochinttidanno be7ize ne aday nees anjjo inggoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Luqa. 18:10-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>Yin woossize wode ammanoosse asunts gaara cer qaala gaantsi woossippete. Un qaalito mahi mahi woossin Xoozii si7ine ga7i qoppane. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Yinnii gisho, unttinni gaar yiippete. Akkos gayko, yin aday yinttis akko koshshizako yin woossodanippa tiino erane.<verse eid="MAT 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>«Yikke, yin yaga7i woossote:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">«Salo yeze nu adayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">ne geeshi suntsita anjjintto.<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Ne ka7itumtta yo7o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">ne qoftta salo hyanidanni fana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">sa7an hyano.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Hyayno qumtto nuus inggo.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Nu nuna qohiduntsis, atto gaazanni fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">nuusin nu qohito atto ga7o.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Nuna iitappa ashshop attin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">faatana geltsippe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Ka7itumon, wolqqan bonchchon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">medhina nees. Amin77e.]<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>«Yin yinttana qohizuntsana atto gayko, salo yeze yin Aday yin qohito atto gawuda. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Yezin yin melle as nagara atto ga7anxiko yin Aday yin nagartto atto ga7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:25-26">Mar. 11:25-26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooma baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>«Yin xoomize wode cubbuntsi fana yiippete. Akkos gayko, un xoomizanno asi erode fana fa sintto bootstsane. Ta turo ohine; un fa shilimaatto ekkida.<verse eid="MAT 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>«Yezin ne xoomize wode ne sintto meecco, ne ommito tizho. <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>Yinnii gaar ne yiiziko ne xoomize xoomtta asappa genggida, yezin geema yeze ne Aday erize xooma maaqqada. Geema oochinttidanno be7ize ne Aday nees shilmaate inggoda.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Salo qolo shiishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>«Bila mu7ize bessa, meqo birize sa7a, kayzo bookkii ekkize sa7a, hyanna sa7ite, yinttis qolo shiishippete. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Yezin bila mo7oosse bessa, meqo biroosse bessa, kayzo bookkii ekkoosse bessa salo yinttis qolo shiishote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:2">Yay. 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Ne qoltta yeze besite ne wozintta yessada.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>«Aafe asatitsis xomppe. Yinnii gisho, ne aafita faxa maaqqiko ne kumutsi asatitsita foo7o maaqqane. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Ne aafita hyargginttiza maaqqiko ne kumutsi asatitsita dhuma maaqqane. Yikke, ne gidda yeze foo7ize dhuma maaqqiko, dhuma akko gaar aadhii dhuma maaqqade!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>«Fettii asi lam77i Laatstsis aqodes dandda7oos. Fetaya kadhiko hyankkaya ixxane; woy fetaya bonchchiko hyankkaya leqqane. Xoozisin miishesin wolal aqodes dandda7oos.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un7inttippete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luqa. 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>«Yikke, si7ote! yin de7o yessades, ‹Akko ma7ade? Akko ushshade? Akko ma77ode?› ga7i un7inttippete; shemppo katstsappa woy galla ma7oppa aadhoso? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Afa landduntsana bo7ote; un budoos, maxoos, facha geltsoos, yezin yin salo aday unttana muuzane. Yin unttappa gaama aadhoso? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Yin giddappa gaama un7intti fa laytsitilla afa fettii qamma gujjodes dandda7ize yene?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>«Mahi yin ma7ize bazis akkos un7intte? Ane fudhuntsana bo7ote, oochchii labboos woy suqqoos. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Si7ote! Melle atto yezin, kaat Solomone fa bonchcho ubbanne hyanna fudhitippa fetay gaar ma77ikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Yin, ammano faccezuntso, Xoozii hyayno benttii wontta tama wodhdhodes yeze maata yeyzi ma7isizebaz maaqqiko, yinttana unttappa aatsii wayzi ma7isoso?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Kat. 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Zeena 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>Yinnii gisho, ‹Akko mo7ode? Akko ushshade? Akko ma7ade?› ga7i un7inttippete. <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Yinno ubbanno Xooz ammanoose asuntsi gaantsi denggodes un7inttane. Yin salo aday yinna ubbanna yinttis koshshizanno erane. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Yezin ubbappa tiino Xoozze ka7itumtton E xillotitsito koyote; yinna ubbanna yinttis gujunttoda. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Yinnii gisho, wonttas qoppittera un7inttippete. Wonttana wonttas aqo; fettii fettii qammize faas maaqqade madhara yene.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Melluntsalla afa firddippete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-42">Luqa. 6:37-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>«Yinttalla afa firddinttaame fana melluntsalla afa firddippete. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Akkos gayko, melluntsalla afa yin firddizanni fana yinttalla afa firddinttoda; yin melluntsis makkide bazite yinttis mahi makinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Ne aafte yeze tuus fana yezaya bi7ikaayzara ne ishay aafte yeze buuriza akkos be7e?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mar. 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Ne aafte tuusi yessadera ne ishay aafte yeze buuriza kesso gawudes wayzi dandda7e? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Naate cubbuzayo, tiinii ne aafte yeze tuusi fana yezaya kesso. Yinnippa suuba, ne ishay aafte yeze buuriza kessodes ne geeshi be7ada.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>«Suuba maaqqii yinttana dha7aame fana geeshi baz kanuntsis olippete. Fa tohite yedhdhii iissaame fana yin al77o baz gudayluntsi tiino olippete.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woossote, koyote, qunkkote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luqa. 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>«Woossote yinttis ingginttoda, koyote yin denggoda, furtsito qunkkote yinttis buginttoda. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Woossize oodesin ingginttoda, koyze oodesin benttoda, furtsito qunkkizesin buginttoda.<verse eid="MAT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>«Yin giddappa na7ay boora woossiko shuchchi inggize oode? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Woy molo woossiko shooshi inggize yene? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Yeezin yin iita maaqqitera yin na7untsis lo77o baz ingge eriko, yin salo aday fana woossizuntsis lo77o baz wayzi gaantsi inggaamo? <verse eid="MAT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>Melluntsi yinttis oochchode fana yin koyze baz ubba yinttin melluntsis oochchote. Akkos gayko, Muse higgiten nabuntsi tamaarssizannan hyanno.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>«Xuuntsi furtsara gelote; akkos gayko, dhabses kanggize ogize damma, furtsitan dalgga. Iira gelize asuntsi gaama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:31">Luqa. 6:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Yezin de7ogo kanggize ogitan furtsitan xuuntsi; yeyga gelize asuntsin eeratsi.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minxa fa aafte erinttane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luqa. 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>«Afara duro aazii fa gaatsite suudhume maaqqii yin gidda gelize worddo nabuntsappa naaginttote. <figure style="fig" alt="Sheep and wolves" file="LB00011B.TIF" size="span" ref="7:15">Duron Suudhumen </figure> <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Yin unttana, un aafitippa eroda; anggatsappa woyne aafe, kenchikeloppa hyalimo maxinttoos. <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Yinnii fana lo77o minxa ubba lo77o aafe aafane; iita minxa iita aafe aafane. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Lo77o minxa iita aafe aafoos, mahi iita minxa lo77o aafe aafodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Lo77o aafe aafoosse minxa ubba gachchintti tama olinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Yinnii gisho, yin unttana, un aafte eroda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Maato. 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Luqa. 3:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>«Salo yeze ta aday qoftto oochchize asi salo ka7itumo geloddepp attin cer tana ‹Laatstso, Laatstso› gaaze ubba salo ka7itumo geloos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Maato. 12:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Firdda qamma gaamuntsi, ‹Laatstso, Laatstso, ne suntsite tinbbite ohika? Ne suntsite tuna ayyaana kessika? Ne suntsite kille baz oochchika?› yaga7oda. <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Ye wode taanii, ‹Ta yinttana mulon eroos, yin iita oochchizuntso taappa hyaakkote› gawuda.<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>«Yikke, hyanna ta qaaltto si7i oochchize ooden fa keetsito lallalla afa keexxide wozinara yeze asi fana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Maz. 6:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Ira bukkida, hyaro goggida, baqo baqii ye keetsiza urqqida. Yezin keetsita lallalla keexinttide gisho gol7ikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>Hyanna ta qaaltto si7i oochchoose ooden fa keetsito shafella afa keexxide booza atstsa aazane. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Ira bukkida, hyaro goggida, baqo baqii, ye keetsiza urqqin, ye keetsize gol7ida; E gol7itan damma» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28-29"/>Yesuusa fa ohito hyaaside wode E timirttita higge asttamaarunts fana maaqqaanxi adetits wolqqar maaqqide gisho asuntsi E timirttite gaama qoppida.<verse eid="MAT 7:28-29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa qursuma hyargginttiza fatstsida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar. 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luqa. 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Yesuusa derizeppa wodhize wode gaama asuntsi eza kaallida. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Yikke fettii qursuma hyargginttize eego shiiqii, E tiintte bunqqunttii, «Laatstso, ne qofa maaqqiko tana geeshi fatstsodes dandda7ane» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesuusa fa kushito dakkii eza bochchii, «Yee, ta qofa, faxo» yagayda. Atstse iira geezhi attida. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Yesuusa eego, «Ne faxito oodesin ohippe. Yezin hyanggi ne geezhi faxidanno kahinunts beezo. Ne faxidannis markka maaqqade fana hyanggi Muse kiittide zharshito zharsho» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1">Leewe 14:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mato hyalaqize ammano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesuusa Qifirnahoome katama yellide wode fettii mato hyalaqize eego shiiqii, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>«Laatstso, ta arize wobbii gaama waayintti, kara woy7i yene» yaga7i woossida.<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Taanii hyanggi eza fatstsoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Yezin mato hyalaqize mahi, «Laatstso, ne ta kara gelodes ta beezze as baaya, yezin ne hyayga bettii qaala xalaala oho, ta arize faxoda. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Akkos gayko, taappa kattara ta kiitinttize asuntsi yene, mahi taappa gaatsara taas kiitinttizuntsi yene. Unttappa fetaya, ‹Qito› gayko qitane; hyankkaya mahi ‹hyankka yo7o!› gayko ye7ine. Ta ariza, ‹Hyanno yiizo› gayko yiizane» gayda.<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesuusa yinno si7ide wode gaama qoppii, fana kaallize asuntsago, «Ta yinttis turo ohine; taanii hyannii gaarize ammano Isra7eele as giddan bi7ikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Ta yinttis ohine; gaamuntsi awa kessappan awa geloppa yi7i, salo ka7itumo Abrahamara, Yisaaqaran Yayqoobara fettilla bettoda. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Yezin salo ka7itumo laattodes beezzin attiduntsana bale dhuma oloda. Ize unttis yeefon achchi garccingge maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Yesuusa mato hyalaqizego, «Ne kara hyanggo, ne ammanttii fana nees hyano» yagayda. E arize iira faxii attida.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa gaama hyargginttizuntsana fatstsida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar. 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luqa. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yesuusa Phexiroosa kara gelize wode Phexiroosa machiti intta omma otstsi misha hyarggera hyarggintti woy7i yezanno bi7ida. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Yesuusa I kushito bochchide wode otsitan michita ashshii ashshida. Faxii denddii eza mokkida.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Ye wode ugure tuna ayyaanara aykinttide gaama asuntsana, asuntsi Yesuusago ki7ida. Ezin tuna ayyaanuntsana fa qaaltte kessida, hyargginttizuntsana ubba fatstsida. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Yinnen nabe Isayaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">«E nu iita hyarggito faas ekkida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">E nu hyarggito tookkida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 8:17">gayde qaaltta folinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa. 53:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kaallizuntsana yellize madha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luqa. 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Yesuusa gaama asuntsi E kale eqqidanno bi7i, abbappa seko fintsa fiinggode fana fa tamaaruntsana kiittida. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Higge asttamaaruntsappa fetay, «Asttamaarzayo, ne hyanggize bessa ubbanne ta kaalloda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesuusa eego «Workkanuntsis olla yene, salo landduntsis keetstsi yene. Yezin As na7ays fa ommito shemppize bessi baaya» yagayda.<figure style="fig" alt="Fox" file="BK00050B.TIF" size="span" ref="8:20">Workkana</figure><verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Yesuusa kaallize asuntsappa fetay, «Laatstso, taanii tiino hyanggi ta adaya moogii yo7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Yezin Yesuusa, «Hyayqqiduntsi fa hyayquntsana moogo; ne tana kaallo» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa abba zulits si77i yiizida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar. 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luqa. 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Yesuusa yedhdhades gongge gelide wode E tamaaruntsin eera qitodes gelida. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Un qoppikaayzara yezin, damma zuluntte hyaatsitilla afa denddin gonggito qoodhdhodes yellida. Yezin Yesuusa genttida. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>E tamaaruntsi eego shiiqii eza barkkitsii, «Laatstso, nu dhabane nuna ashshoya» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Yin, ammano faccezuntso, akkos zhashitete?» yagayda. Denddii, zuluntton zhuubito si7i yizida. Ellisi ubba baz si7i gayda.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>E tamaaruntsi gaama qoppii, «Hyay, melle atto yezin, zuluntten zhuubban kiitinttize wayde aso?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuna ayyaana aykkide lam77i asuntsana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar. 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luqa. 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Yesuusa abbappa seko fintsa yeze Gerggesoone gaaze sa7a yellide wode tuna ayyaana aykkide lam77i asuntsi boozappa kezii eera yellinttida. Un gaama iitan zhashize as maaqqide gisho asi yinna bestira aadhodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Unttin, «Xoozze na7ayo, neera nuna akko yelitsize? Wode yellikaaya yezin nuna firddodes yi7ida?» ga7i uukkida.<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Unttappa gaama hyakkikaayzar guudayile wude yengginttane. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Tuna ayyaanuntsi Yesuusa, «Ne nuna kessode baz maaqqiko, seko gudayluntsi wude gidda dakkoya» yaga7i woossida.<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Yesuusa, «Qitote» yagayda. Tuna ayyaana asuntsappa kezii gudayluntsago gelida. Gudayluntsin ubba gaga doonara woxxii hyanggi abba qoodhintti hyayqida.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Gudayille wude yenggizuntsin woxxii katama hyanggi, hyanide bazin tuna ayyaana aykkide asuntsalla afa oochchidanno ubba ohida. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Yeezin, katama yeze asuntsi ubbuntsi Yesuusa bo7odes kezida. Un Yesuusa bi7ide wode fa gaditippa kezii qitode fana woossida.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Wobbo atstse faxito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar. 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luqa. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa gonggite gelii, abba fiinggi fa katama qitida. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Ize eerats asuntsi fettii wobbo atstsa alggara tookkii Yesuusago ki7ida. Yesuusa un ammantto bi7i, wobbo atstsa, «Ta na7ayo, zhashtippe! Ne nagartta atto ga7inttida» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Yinna saate, Ayhude higge asttamaaruntsappa fete fete, «Hyanna Xooz cazhe baane» yaga7i fa wozintte qoppida.<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesuusa un qoftto erii, «Iita baz yin wozintte akkos qoppete? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Yezin, ‹Ne nagartta atto ga7inttida› gaazannippan ‹Denddii eqqii qito› gaazannippa ayye foolle? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Yezin sa7alla afa nagara atto gawudes As na7as adetita wolqqa yezanno ta yinttana erisoda» yaga7i, wobbo atstsego, «Denddii, ne alggiza tookkii, kara qito» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Wobbo atstse denddii fa kara qitida. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Worzhita yinno bi7i gaama qoppida. Yinnii fana adetits wolqqa asis inggide Xoozza galatida.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maatoosa xeegintte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar. 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luqa. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesuusa yeygappa denddii hyanggitera Maatoosa gaaze qaraxe gachchize bessa bettii yezin bi7i, «Tana kaallo» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Ezin denddii kaallida.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Yesuusa Maatoosa kara leematella bettii yezin, qaraxe gachchize gaama asuntsin nagaranchchuntsi yi7i eeran E tamaaruntsara wolla mo7odes bettida. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Fettii fettii Farisaawuntsi yinno bi7i, Yesuusa tamaaruntsara, «Yin asttamaarize qaraxe gachchizuntsaran nagaranchchuntsara akkos me7e?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luqa. 15:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yesuusa yinno si7i, «Gaalla koshshize hyargginttizuntsap fattin faxuntsis baaya. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Yezin yin hyanggi, ‹Taanii yin zharshito baayzin yin melluntsana maarode fana koyane› ga7intti xaafinttidanna waagizako erote. Akkos gayko, taanii nagaranchchuntsana xeegodes yi7idap attin xilluntsana xeegodes yi7ikaaya» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Maato. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hose. 6:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa xooma baz oocinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar. 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luqa. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Ye wode Wahannisa tamaaruntsi Yesuusago shiiqin, «Nuunin Farisaawuntsin xoomane, yezin ne tamaaruntsi akkos xoomoso?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesuusa mahi unttago, «Mushura unttara yezin xeegintti yi7ide asuntsi azzanodes dandda7ane? Mushura un kaleppa ekkinttode wode yo7oda, un ye wode xoomoda.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>«Kille ma7oppa feedhii gal77a ma7olla sikkize ooden baaya. Yinnii fana yeyziko killize gal77iza feedhane. Feedhitsitan wozzii dalggane. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Kille woyne gal77a silphe gujjize ooden baaya. Yinnii fana yeyziko kille woynize gal77a silphiza dhuussane woynizen lanttane; silphizen lam7intsa maaddoose baz maaqqane. Yezin kille woyne kille silphe gujjodes beezane. Yinnii fana yeyziko lam77untsin iitikaayzara naaginttane» yagayda. <figure style="fig" alt="Wineskin" file="LB00145B.TIF" size="span" ref="9:17">Woyne silphe</figure><verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hyayqqide na7iton Yesuusa ma7ito bochchide maachito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar. 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luqa. 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Yesuusa yinna ohitilla afa yezin, Ayhude hyalaquntsappa fetay eego yi7i, E tiino bunqqunttii, «Ta na7ita hyatte hyayqqida, yezin iza faxode fana ne yi7i ne kushito iilla afa gaddoyo» ga7i woossida. <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yesuusa denddii eera hyanggida; E tamaaruntsin kaallida.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>E hyanggizin taphpho lam77i bere kumutsi suutsi googii waaytsize fettii maachita suubara shiiqii Yesuusa ma7iti macartto bochchida. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Iza fa wozintte, «Ta E ma7iti macartto xalaala bochchizako faxoda» yaga7i qoppida.<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesuusa suub maaqqii izo bi7i, «Ta na7ite, zhashitippe! Nena ne ammantta fatstsida» yagayda. Astan iira faxii attida.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Yesuusa Ayhude hyalaqize kara yellide wode zaye fuggizuntsanan yeekizuntsana bi7i, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>«Ane hyal7ote; eerats na7ita genttidap attin hyayqqikaaya» yagayda. Yezin asuntsi eella afa miicida. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Asuntsana bale kessidannippa suuba keetstsa gelii, na7iti kushito aykkida, na7itan denddii eqqida. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Yinna ohita yinna sa7ito ubba yellida.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa lam77i qooquntsana fatstsida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Yesuusa yeygappa denddii gode tiino hyanggodera lam77i qooquntsi fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Dawute na7ayo, nuna maaroya» yagaytira eza kaallida.<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Yesuusa keetstsa gelize wode qooquntsi eza kaallii yellida. Yesuusa unttago, «Taanii yinno oochchodes dandda7izanno yin ammananete?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Unttin, «Yee, Laatstso» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa un aafto bochchii unttago, «Yinttis, yin ammanttii fana hyano» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Un aafitan bugunttida. Yesuusa unttago, «Hyanno oodesin ohippete» yaga7i mintsii ohida. <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Yezin asuntsi hyanggi Yesuusa baz yinna sa7ite ubba ohida.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Un yeygappa kezze wode asuntsi tuna ayyaana aykkii muumuzide fettii asi Yesuusago ki7ida. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Tuna ayyaana kezideppa suuba muume atstse ohinttida. Asuntsin gaama qoppida, «Yinnii fana kille baz Isra7eele sa7a hyanikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Yezin Farisaawuntsi, «Tuna ayyaanunts hyalaqara tuna ayyaanuntsana kessane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Maato. 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar. 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luqa. 11:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa asuntsis yiqsinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesuusa Ayhude woosa keetstsa tamaarssitera, salo ka7itumo Wonggele sabbakitera, asuntsana hyargge ubbappa fatstsitera kataman kara gancce ubbanne wutida. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Gaama worzhita, yenggize asi baayze duro fana unttana be7ize asi dhabin un yezanno bi7i unttis yiqsinttida. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Fa tamaaruntsago, «Shiiqode katsita gaama, yezin katsito shiishize asuntsi eeratsi. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Yinnii gisho, Laatstsi katstsa shiishode oochanchchuntsana dakkode fana woossote» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa kiittide taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar. 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luqa. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesuusa taphpho lam77i tamaaruntsana faago xeegii, tuna ayyaana kessode fanan hyargge ubbappa fatstsode fana unttis adetits wolqqa inggida.<verse eid="MAT 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Yesuusa kiittide taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsi suntsita; tiinize Phexiroosa gaaze Simoona E ishe Inddiriyase, Zabdiyoosa na7a Yayqooban E ishe Wahannisan, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filphoosa Bartolomiyoosa, Toomaasa qaraxe gachchize Maatoosa, Ilfiyoosa na7a Yayqooba, Taadiyosa, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>fa gaditis yiqsinttize Simoonan Yesuusa aatsii inggide Yesqorootu Yihuda.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Yinna taphpho lam77untsi Yesuusa kiittii dakkitera, «Ayhude maaqqoosse worzhago hyanggippete, mahi Samaara asunts kataman gelippete. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Yezin Isra7eele keetstsappa maaqqide sekka dhabide duruntsago hyanggote. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Ize hyanggi, ‹Salo ka7itumo ukkida› ga7i ohote. <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Hyargginttizuntsana fatstsote, hyayqqiduntsana hyayqqoppa dentstsote, qursuma hyargginttizuntsana geeshii fatstsote, tuna ayyaana kessote. Yin hyarii ekkidanno hyarii inggote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-12">Luqa. 10:4-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Yin kiistte worqqa, woy bira santtime aykkippete. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>Yin oges karxite, lam77i ma7o, woy caamma woy gufe aykkippete; oochchizuntsis hyayno quma beezane.<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>«Yin fettii katama woy kara gancce gelize wode yinttana mokkii ekkodes ufayttize asi koyi E kara gelote; yin qitode wontsis ize gam7ote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Qoro. 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Ximo. 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Mahi oode karan gelitera saritsote. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Yinna keetsita yinttana mokkiko yin saritside sartta unttana yello, yezin un mokkanxiko yin saritside sartta yinttis suub maaqqo. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Ooden yinttana mokkanxiko yin ohize baz si7anxiko yinna keetsitifa woy yinna katamttippa kezitera yin tohite yeze xurito fixxii kezote. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Ta yinttis turo ohine; Xoozze firdda qamma yinna katamttippa Soodomasin gamoora katamitis firdda eeroda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Hawa. 13:51</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>«Ta yinttana duro fana suudhumuntsi gidda dakkoda. Yinnii gisho, shooshi fana cincca, wolle fana aada maaqqote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Maato. 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Medho 19:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Asuntsi yinttana firddize daynnuntsis aatsii inggoda, mahi Ayhude woosa keetstsa yinttana garaafoda. Yinnii gisho, unttappa naaginttote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:3">Luqa. 10:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Ta gisho ga7i yinttana worzhito ahizunts tiino kaatuntsi tiino kanggoda. Un tiintte Ayhude maaqqoosse worzhunts tiino eqqii yin ta baz markkidhoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:9-11">Mar. 13:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luqa. 12:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21:12-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Yezin yinttana firddas aatsii inggize wode waaga7i mahode ga7i un7inttippete; yinna saate yin gawude baz Xoozii yinttis inggoda. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Akkos gayko, yinttana ohize yin Aday Geeshi Ayyaanappa attin yinttana baaya.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>«Ishay fa ishaya, aday fa na7aya, hyayqos aatsii inggoda, na7untsi fana yeliduntsalla afa denddii unttana wodhissada. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Ta gisho ga7i asi ubbuntsi yinttana ixxoda, yezin wurssutsi yellodes miinggide attoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mar. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Luqa. 21:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Fettii kara gancceppa yinttana un bay7iko melle katama bettote. Taanii yinttis turo ohine; As Na7ay yo7ode wontsis, yin Isra7eele katama ubba kantsaama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Maato. 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar. 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:17">Luqa. 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:13">Maato. 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar. 13:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>«Tamaaruntsi fa asttamaarzeppa, arizen fa laatstseppa aadhoos. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Tamaarize fa asttamaarize, arize fa laatstsize fana yiiko ees maaqqada. Karttii aday Bi7elzebuula gayko E kara asuntsana wayzi wozzii iissii xeegoso?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luqa. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Waha. 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>«Yikke, asis zhashitippete. Geenggide baz qonccoda, Aachinttide baz geesha kezikaayzara attoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Maato. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar. 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luqa. 11:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Taanii yinttis dhuma ohize baz yin foo7o ohote; ta yinttis hyaye kalkashide baz zoozella awaajjote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar. 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luqa. 8:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Ashop attin shemppo wodhodes dandda7osuntsis zhashitippete. Yezin shemppiton ashton gaanname dhabssodes dandda7ize Xoozzes zhashtote. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Lam77i buubbe landduntsi fettii santtime bayzinttoossane? Yi7op attin, unttappa fetayn yin Xoozze gaykaayzin sa7a wodhdhoos. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Melle atto yezin, yin omma isintsitan faydintti yene. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Yikke, gaama buubbe landduntsappa yin aadhize gisho zhashitippete.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>«As tiino taas markkidhize ubbuntsis taanin salo yeze ta aday tiino markkidhada. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Yezin as tiino tana kaddizaya taanin salo yeze ta aday tiino kaddoda.<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>«Taanii sa7alla lo77o ko7odes yi7ida yinttis aazippe. Taanii olappa attin sarotits ko7odes yi7ikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">2 Ximo. 2:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Taanii yi7idanna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">«Na7aya adeppa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">maachi na7ito inttippa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">Na7ay machchito azinze inttippa shaakkodes.<verse eid="MAT 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Asis morkkuntsi E kara asuntsana maaqqoda.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik. 7:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>«Taappa aatsii fa adaya woy fa intto kadhize, ta baz maaqqodes beezoos. Fa dhiiratsi na7aya woy fa maachi na7ito taappa aatsii kadhize, ta baz maaqqodes beezoos. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Fa masqala tookkii tana kaalloosse ooden ta baz maaqqodes beezoos. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Fa shemppito ashshodes koyze dhabssoda, yezin fa shemppito ta gisho aatsii inggize ashshoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Maato. 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar. 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luqa. 9:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>«Yinttana mokkize tana mokkane, tana mokkize mahi tana kiittidaya mokkane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Maato. 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luqa. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Waha. 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Nabe nabe suntsite mokkize, nabe fana waaga ekkoda; mahi xilliza xillo suntsite mokkize, xillize fana waaga ekkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luqa. 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Waha. 13:20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luqa. 9:48</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Ta yinttis turo ohine; hyantsi ta tamaaruntsappa eerize fetay tana kaallize gisho melle atto yezin eeratsi toya hyaatsi inggiko E waagita dhaboos» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqize Wahannisa kiittide asuntsana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luqa. 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesuusa taphpho lam77i tamaaruntsana kiittii hyaasidannippa suuba izippa denddii tamaarssodesin sabbakodes Galila katama qitida.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Wahannisa achi keetstsa yezara Kiristtoosa oochito si7i, fa tamaaruntsappa eego kiittii, <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>«Yo7oda ga7inttide nenane? Woy nu melle kafode?» ga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesuusa unttago mahi, «Hyanggi yin si7ide bazin yin bi7idebaz Wahannisas ohote. <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>Qooquntsi be7ine, wobbuntsi yedhdhane, qursuma hyargginttizuntsi geezhane, tulluntsi si7ine, hyayqqiduntsi hyayqoppa denddane; dahuntsis Wonggele sabbakinttane. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Taara dhubunttoosse anjjinttidaya» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa. 35:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Wahannisa tamaaruntsi suub maaqqii hyanggin, Yesuusa worzhuntsis Wahannisa baz ohitera, «Hyanna akko baayze ganasa akko be7ades yi7idate? Baqo en7ize shombboqo be7ades yi7idate? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Yeezin, akko be7ades yi7idate? Bonchcho ma7o ma77ide asuntsana be7adesine? Bonchcho ma7o ma77iduntsi kaat kara yene. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Yeezin, akko be7ades kezidote? Nabe be7adesine? Yee, yin nabeppan aadhizaya be7ine.<verse eid="MAT 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>«Ne ogito ne tiintte giigize</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">ta kiitanchchiza neeppa tiino kiittoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 11:10">ga7intti xaafinttidanna ees.<verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Ta yinttis turo ohine; maachippa yelinttiduntsi giddappa xammaqize Wahannisappa aadhize oonin denddikaaya; yezin salo ka7itumo ubbuntsappa eerize E, eeppa aadhoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Xammaqize Wahannisa wodeppa dentsii hyayno yellodes salo ka7itumo gaama urqqinttane, miinggi butunttizunts denggoda. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Nabunts ubbuntsi higgen Wahannisa baz tinbbite ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:16">Luqa. 16:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Yikke, yin un kiitto ammanodebaz maaqqiko, yo7oda ga7inttide Eeliyaasa, E Wahannisa. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Yikke, si7ize hyaye yeze si7o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10">Maato. 17:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>«Yikke, taanii hyanna wode yeletto akkora aazissade? Gabe gidda bettii wol xeegii,<verse eid="MAT 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>« ‹Nu yinttis suulunqe fuggin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">yin yexxikaaya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">Nu nashshii gayrin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">yin yeekkikaaya›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 11:17">yagaaze na7untsana aazane. <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Xammaqize Wahannisa mu7ikaayzaran uzhikaayzara yi7in, ‹Tuna ayyaana yene› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>As na7ay mu7iteran uzhitera yi7in, ‹Zhimbbaran ushi asi, qaraxe gachchizuntsisin nagaranchchunts igina› yagayda. Yikke, cinccatitsin turetitsi E oochite qonccane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammananxi ixxide katamuntsana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luqa. 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa gaama kille baz oochchide katamuntsi gidda yeze asuntsi fa nagarttippa maaqqii maarotitsi gelanxi ixxide gisho unttana, <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>«Bade Koraaziine katamite, bade Beetesayida katamite, akkos gayko, yin gidda oochinttide kille baz Xiroosa giddan Sidoona gidda oochinttidebaz maaqqizako, un zaga budo tizhintti, kayo afula ma77i fa nagarttippa maaqqii attod yeshsha. <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Yezin ta yinttis ohine; firdda qamma yinttappa aatsii Xiroosasin Sidoonasi firddita eeroda. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Mahi, Qifirnahoome, neenii ude salo kezodes koyane? Hyanoos! Ne si7oole olinttoda. Akkos gayko, ne gidda oochchinttide kille baz Soodoma oochchinttidebaz maaqqizako, Soodoma hyayno yellodes yessad yeshsha. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Yezin ta nees ohine; firdda qamma neeppa aatsii Soodomas firdda eeroda».<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13">Isa. 14:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa yeze shemppo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luqa. 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Ye wode Yesuusa, «Adayo, salo sa7a Laatstso, ne hyanno eruntsappan cincuntsappa aachchii na7untsis qonccizide gisho nena galatane. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Yee, ta Adayo, hyanna ne lo77o qoftti fana hyanida.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>«Ubbanna taas ta Adeppa ingginttida. Adayppa melle na7aya erize baaya, na7ayppan E qonccodes koyezuntsappa melle Adaya erodes dandda7ize baaya.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>«Yin, labbiduntso, toofo deexide ubbuntsi taago hyanka yo7ote; ta yinttana shemppisada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Waha. 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Waha. 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Taanii ta wozintte dalggan aada maaqqide gisho ta qambbartto tookkote, taappa tamaarote; yin, yin shemppitis shemppo denggoda. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Ta qambbartta sila, mahi ta toofitan foollo» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Er. 6:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Sambbata bazis shiiqide ooce</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar. 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luqa. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Ye wode, Sambbata qamma, Yesuusa gade giddara aadhida. Yesuusa tamaaruntsi naydhdhide gisho tizha bangga shicci dha7ane. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Yezin Farisaawuntsi yinno bi7i Yesuusago, «Hyaychche, ne tamaaruntsi Sambbata qamma oochchodes beezoosse baz oochchane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Mahe 23:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesuusa unttago mahi, «Dawute naydhdhide wode eera yezuntsara akko oochchezako nabbabikate? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Dawute Xoozze keetstsa gelii kahinuntsi xalaalap attin eesin eera yezuntsis beezoosse geeshi daabbo mu7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam. 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Woy kahinuntsi Sambbata woga shaarii Xoozze keetstsa Sambbata qamma oocha oochchiko unttis bala baayzanno Muse higgeppa nabbabikate?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Leewe 24:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Yezin ta ohine! Xoozze keetstsappa aadhize hyanne yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Faydo 28:9-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>‹Taanii yin zharshito baayzin yin melluntsana maarode fana koyda› gaaze qaaltta waagizako yin erezako geeshi asuntsalla afa firddaama yeshsha. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>As na7ay Sambbata Laatstsi» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Maato. 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hose. 6:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesuusa yeygappa kezii Ayhude woosa keetstsa gelida. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Ize kushe wobbo fettii asi yene. Yesuusa mootodes mikinaate koyze asuntsi, «Sambbata qamma fatstsodes beezanene beezoso?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>E unttago, «Yin giddappa fetays duro Sambbata qamma gaga qitiko, gochchii keesoose oode? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Yeezin asi duroppa wayzi gaama aadhoso? Yinnii gisho, Sambbata qamma ubba lo77o baz oocha beezane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:5">Luqa. 14:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa atstsego, «Ne kushito luulizo yaga7in,» atstse luulizida. E kushize faxii hyankay kushe fana yi7ida. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Yezin Farisaawuntsi yeygappa bale kezii, Yesuusa wayzi wodhod yezako zorinttida.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozii dooride ariza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Yesuusa un qoftto erii yinna besito ashshii melle bessa qitida. Gaama asuntsi eza kaallii qitida, hyargganchchuntsana ubba fatstsida. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Yesuusa, «Ta baz melle oodesin ohippete» yaga7i mintsii ohida. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Yinnan nabize Isayaasa,<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>«Hyaychche ta dooride arize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">ta kadhize, tana ufaysize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">taanii ta ayyaana, eella afa gaddoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">E, Ayhude maaqqoosse worzhitis firdda awaajjoda.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>E lalloos woy uukkoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">E qaaltton oge cer si7ize baaya.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Firdda gamii denddode wontsis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">donccinttide shombboqo mentsoos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">cugize shombboqo fana dhabsoos.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Worzha ubba eella ufayssi gaddoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 12:21">yaga7i xaafinttidanna folinttode fana.<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusan Bi7elzebuulan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar. 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luqa. 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Yinnippa suuba, tuna ayyaanara aykinttide qooqen doona muume asi yezaya eego ki7ida. Yesuusa atstsa fatstsin, atstse be7inen ohinttane. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Asuntsi ubbuntsi gaama qoppii, «Hyay Dawute na7a maaqqada yessane?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Yezin Farisaawuntsi yinno si7i, «Hyay atstse tuna ayyaanuntsana kessize tuna ayyaanunts hyalaqa Bi7elzebuula wolqqara» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yesuusa un qoftto erii, «Wol gidda shaakkinttize ka7itumo ubba gol7oda; mahi wol gidda shaakkinttize katamita woy keetsita miinggi eqqoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Maato. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Xalahe xalahe kessizebaz maaqqiko fa gidda shaakkinttane ga7intte. Yinnii fana hyanizebaz maaqqiko E ka7itumtta wayzi miinggi eqqodes dandda7e? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Taanii tuna ayyaana kessize Bi7elzebuula wolqqara maaqqiko yinttana kaallize asuntsi oode wolqqara kessode? Yinnii gisho, yinttana kaallize asuntsi yinttana firddoda. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Yezin taanii tuna ayyaana kessize Xooz Ayyaanara maaqqiko, Xoozze ka7itumo yinttago yi7ida.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>«Woy fettii asi wolqqara yeze atstse kara gelii E qoltto bonqodes koyko tiinii ye atstsa accanxiko wayzi bonqodes dandda7ode? Yeyziko E qoltto bonqodes dandda7ane.<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>«Taara maaqqoosse ooden tana ixxane; mahi taara fettilla shiishoosse ubba lalane. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Yinnii gisho, ohine; asuntsi oochchize akko nagaran cashshi qaala ubba atto ga7inttoda, yezin Geeshi Ayyaana cazhize oodesin E nagartta atto ga7inttaama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar. 9:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Ooden As na7alla afa iita baz ohiko ees atto ga7inttoda, yezin Geeshi ayyaanalla afa iita baz ohize oodesin hyanne sa7ite maaqqikon yo7ode alamite E nagartta atto ga7inttaama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luqa. 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>«Lo77o minxa lo77o aafe aafane; mahi iita minxa iita aafane. Yikke, minxa erinttize fa aafte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luqa. 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Yin, shooshi na7untso, yin iita maaqqitera wayzi lo77o baz oochchodes dandda7e? Asi fa wozina kumidanno doonara ohine. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Lo77o asi fa wozinttippa, lo77o baz kessane; iita asi fa wozinappa, iita baz kessane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Maato. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luqa. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:18">Maato. 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:45">Luqa. 6:45</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>Yezin si7ote, asuntsi ohinttize cer ohe ubbas firdda qamma mahe inggoda. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Akkos gayko, ne ohize ne qaaltte xilloda; ne ohize ne qaaltte neella afa firddoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kille baz be7ades shiiqide ooce</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar. 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luqa. 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Yinnippa suuba, fettii fettii Farisaawuntsin higge asttamaaruntsi Yesuusago, «Asttamaarzayo, neeppa kille baz be7ades koyane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Yezin Yesuusa mahi, «Ammaninttoosen iita yeletuntsi kille baz koyane. Yezin nabe Yoonasa kille bazappa melle kille baz unttis ingginttoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:1">Maato. 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar. 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luqa. 11:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Yoonasa molo saza hyaydzdzii awaran hyaydzdzii qamma gam7idanni fana As na7a hyaydzdzii awaran hyaydzdzii qamma sa7a gaatsa gam7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Maato. 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar. 8:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Nenewe asuntsi firdda qamma denddii hyanna yeletuntsara wolla unttalla afa firddoda; akkos gayko, un Yoonasa sibkketo si7i fa nagarttippa maaqqida. Yikke, Yoonasappa aadhize hyanne yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:17">Waha. 1:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Firdda qamma yeekka kaatita denddii hyanna yeletuntsara wolla unttalla afa firddoda; akkos gayko, iza Solomone cinccatitsito si7odes sa7a gaxappa yi7ida. Hyaychche, Solomonappa aadhize hyanne yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Waha. 3:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>«Tuna ayyaana atstseppa kezideppa suuba faas shemppize bessi koyi hyaatsi baayze bessa hyanttane, Yezin fa koyze shemppo denggoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Kat. 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Zeena 9:1-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Yezin, ‹Ta ashshii kezide keetstsite maaqqii hyanggoda› yagaane. E maaqqize wode keetsita kaysi maaqqidannon fixinttii lo77i bettidanno denggane. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Yikke, maaqqii hyanggi, faappa iita melle laappun iita ayyaanuntsana ekkii ye7ine; unttin ize gelii yezane. Ye atstses tiinostippa suubanna gaama iitane. Ye iita yeletuntsalla afa yinnii fana yi7ada» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa intton E ishuntsana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar. 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luqa. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Yesuusa worzhitis ohella afa yezin E inttan E ishuntsi eza ohissades koyi bale eqqida. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Fettii asi eego, «Ne inttan ne ishuntsin nena ohissades koyi bale eqqida» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ta intta oode? Ta ishuntsin oode?» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Fa kushtira tamaaruntsana mallitera, «Bo7ote, ta inttan ta ishuntsin hyantsesana. <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Salo yeze ta Aday qoftto oochchize ubbuntsi taas ishe, taas mishon taas inddo» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Budutsi budize atstse aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar. 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luqa. 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Ye wode Yesuusa karappa kezii abba gaxa bettida. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Gaama asuntsi E kale shiiqin asuntsana abba gaxa ashshii ashshii gongge gelii bettida asuntsin ubba abba gaxa eqqida. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Asuntsis gaama baz aazizera yaga7i ohida:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1">Luqa. 5:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">«Fettii budutsi budize budutsi budodes kezida. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>E budize wode fettii fettii budutsita oge gaxalla wodhdhida; unttana landduntsi yi7i maxii muyda. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Fettii fettii budutsita oomora lalla yeze sa7a wodhdhida. Gaama sa7a baayze gisho ellisii dolida. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Yezin awa kezin shullida; xapho baayze gisho melida. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Fettii fettii budutsita anggats gidda wodhdhida; anggatsita diccii yinna doltto cuullida. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Melluntsi mahi aradda sa7alla wodhdhida; dolii aafe aafida. Fetay xeeti, fetay izipuntam, fetay mahi hyasttam aafida. <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Si7ize hyaye yeze si7o» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsi eego shiiqii, «Akkos ne worzhitis aazizera ohe?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>E mahi, Yinttis salo ka7itumo gaatsi qofa era ingginttida, Yezin unttis ingginttikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Yeze ubbuntsis gujunttoda, ees gaammada, yezin baayzeppa melle atto yezin ees yezayin ekkinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Yinnii gisho, taanii un, bi7itera denggaame fana, si7ittera si7aame fana woy qoppaame fana unttis aazizera ohine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Maato. 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar. 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luqa. 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">19:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Isayaasa fa maxaafite ohidanna unttalla afa folinttida. E ohitera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">«Yin sisi si7ine, yezin qoppoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">yin be7ine, yezin bo7oos.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Akkos gayko, hyantsi asunts wozintta muumida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">fa hyayto doozhizida,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">fa aafto goozida. Yinnippa denddii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">Fa aaftira bo7oos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">fa hyaytiran si7oos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">fa wozintten tiiroos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">taago maaqqades dandda7oos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">taanin unttana fatstsoos yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>«Yezin yin aafta be7ize gishon yin hyayta si7ize gisho anjjinttiduntsana. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Ta yinttis turo ohine; gaama nabuntsin xillo asuntsi yin be7izanno be7ades yin si7izanno si7odes amudhdhida, yezin unttis hyanikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:23-24">Luqa. 10:23-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>«Yikke, hyay budutsito budize atstse aazizto si7ote. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Oge gaxa wodhdhide budutsiti aazizta hyanno; salo ka7itumo qaala si7i tiiroosse atstse wozinttippa Xalahe yi7i E wozintte yeze budutsito maxii hyaasane. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Lalla oomo yeze sa7alla budinttide qaala si7i ellisii ufaytti ekkizuntsana. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Yezin xapho dakkodes dandda7oosse gisho gam7oos. Qaala gisho madha woy baytsi ye7ize wode ellisii dhubinttane. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Anggats gidda budinttide qaala si7ine, yezin hyanna alame yessi yirgappan durtumo qofappa qaaltto cuullide gisho aafe aafanxii attida. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Yezin aradda sa7a buduninttide budutse qofara qaaltto si7ize asi. E aafe aafane; fetay xeet, fetay izipuntam fetay mahi hyasttam aafane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zarddo aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yesuusa unttis melle aazize ohida, «Xoozze ka7itumo fa gadite lo77o budutsi budide atstsa aazane. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Yezin asi ubba genttin E morkkize yi7i zargiti gidda zarddo budi qitida. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Zargita diccii aafodera zarddizen ye wode benttida.<verse eid="MAT 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>«Gaditii aday aruntsii adego hyanggi, ‹Laatstso, ne gadite ne lo77o budutsi budika? Yeezin, zarddo anappa yi7ido? yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>«E unttago, ‹Yinno morkke oochchida› yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">«Aruntsii laatstsego, ‹Nu hyanggi zarddito shoddode gaar koyane?› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>«Yezin E, ‹Atto bochchippe; yin zarddito shoddane gawudera zargita shoddinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Bochchippete; maxize wode yellodes wolla dicco. Ye wode maxizuntsi zarddito tiinii shoddii tamar eetsodes mirqera mirqera gaddote. Yezin zargito shiishii ta fachite geltsote› gawuda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eeratsi minxiti aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar. 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luqa. 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Mahi melle aazize yaga7i ohida; «Salo ka7itumo fettii asi fa gadite budide eeratsi minxa aafe aazane. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Yinna aafita melle minxa aafe ubbappa eeratsi, yezin doltta diccii melle minxa ubbappa aadhii dammane. I zhanggitilla landduntsi keexii bettode wontsis damma minxa maaqqane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irshsho aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luqa. 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Mahin, Yesuusa melle aazize ohida; «Salo ka7itumo fettii maachita hyaydzdzii gabate dhiilla ekkii munuqide, munuqita denddode fana ize gujjide irshsho aazane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesuusa worzhitis yinna aazizto ubba ohida. Aazize baayzin fettii bazin ohikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Nabize fa maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Taanii ta doona, aazizera bugane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">salon sa7an medhinttidannippa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">aachinttidanno ohine»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 13:35">yaga7i ohidanna hyanne folinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Maz. 78:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zarddo aaziziti bilitsito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Yesuusa worzhito moyzii keetstsa gelida. E tamaaruntsi eego shiiqii, «Gade yeze zarddo bilitsito nuus oho» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>E mahi, «Lo77o budutsito budide As Na7a. <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Gadita hyanna alamito. Lo77o budutsita salo ka7itumo na7untsana. Zarddize Xalahe na7untsana. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Zarddiza budide morkke Xalahe. Maxize wodita, wode wurssutsite. Maxizuntsi kiitanchchuntsana.<verse eid="MAT 13:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>«Zarddo maxii tama eetsizanni gaar wode wurssutsite yinnii gaar maaqqada. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>As Na7ay fa kiitanchchuntsana kiittoda. Un nagaras mikinaate maaqqiduntsana iita oochchize ubba maxii E ka7itumttippa kessoda. <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Yeefon achchi garccingge aadhii eexize tama oloda. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Ye wode geeshuntsi fa aday ka7itumtte awa gaar foo7oda. Si7ize hyaye yeze si7o!<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>«Salo ka7itumo gade mooginttide miishe fana. Fettii asi yinna miishito denggi mahi moogida. Gaama ufaytti hyanggi faas yeze baz ubba bayzi yinna oocha gadito wonggida.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>«Yinnii gaara, mahi salo ka7itumo inqo gaaze al77o shuchchi koyze zali7ancho aazane. <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>Gaama al77o inqiza denggi hyanggi faas yeze baz ubba bayzi eza woonggida.<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Molo aykkize gite aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>«Mahi Salo ka7itumo abba olinttide dumma dumma molo aykkize gite aazane. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Molo aykkize asuntsi molo gitite kumin abbappa gaxa kessida. Ize bettii lo77ito qurii qurii daachcho olida, yezin iitto alla olida. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Wode wurssutsite yinnii fana hyanoda. Kiitanchchuntsi yi7i nagaranchuntsana xilunsappa shaakkii, <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>yeefo achchi garccinggen aadhii eexize tama oloda.<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>«Hyanna ubbanna yinttis gelida?» yaga7i unttana oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Un mahi, «Yee» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Yesuusa, «Yikke, salo ka7itumo kaallizen higge tamaare ubba, fa minjjide qoloppa killen gal77a kessize asi aazane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Naazirete ixinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar. 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luqa. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesuusa yinna aazizito ohi hyaasidannippa suuba yeygappa denddii qitida. <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>Fa yelinttide sa7a hyanggi Ayhude woosa keetstsa worzhito tamaarssida. Un gaama qoppii, «Hyay atstse hyanna cinccatitsiton wolqqa kumide kille bazito anappa ekkido? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Hyay anaaxize na7a baane? E inttii suntsita Mayramo baane? E ishuntsi Yayqooba, Yoosefa, Simoonan Yihuda baane? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>E mishuntsi nuura yezuntsana baane? Yeezin, hyay atstse hyanno ubbanno anappa ekkido?» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Yinnii gisho, E gaaze bazito ekkanxi ixxida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:57 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:43">Waha. 4:43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yezin Yesuusa, «Nabe fa yelinttide sa7an fa kara asunts kale bonchinttoos» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Un ammananxide gisho gaama kille baz yinna besite oochchikaaya.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqize Wahannisa hyayqito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar. 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luqa. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Ye wode ahize Heroodisa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Heroodisa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hyayni kaat Heroodisa Anttiphaasa. E Yihudan Peeriyan Kiristtoosa yelinttodannippa tiino 4-39 M. L. yellodes ahida. E kaat Heroodisas na7a.</char></note> Yesuusa baz si7ida. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>Fa aruntsago, «Yikke Xammaqize Wahannisa; E hyayqoppa denddida. Yinnii gisho hyanno ubba kille bazito E oochchane» gayda.<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>E yinno gaydanna Heroodisa fa ishe Filphoosa machchiti Heroodiyada mikinaatera Wahannisa achi keetstsa geltside gisho. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Wahannisa Heroodisago, «Ne izo ekkodes beezoos» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Heroodisa Wahannisa wodhodes koyda, yezin worzhita Wahannisa nabe mahi be7ize gisho zhashtida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luqa. 3:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:16">Leewe 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Heroodisa fa yelinttide qammito bonchchize wode Heroodiyada na7ita asunts tiino yexxitera doollii eza ufayssida. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>Yeezin, E, «Iza koyze baz ubba inggoda ga7i» caaqqida. <verse eid="MAT 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Na7ita fa inttii zore si7i Heroodisago, «Xammaqize Wahannisa ommito gabate gaddii taas inggo» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Iza yaga7in kaatize qoppii azzanida, yezin fa caaqqiti gishon faara yeze zaqqunts gisho ga7i iza oocidanno folode fana kiittida. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Kaatize as kiittii Wahannisa achi keetstsa yezin E afurtto gachchida. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Ommito gabate gaddii ki7i na7itis inggida; na7itan ekkii fa inttis kanggida. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Wahannisa tamaaruntsi yi7i E ahito kanggi moogida. Yinnippa suuba hyanide baz ubba hyanggi Yesuusas ohida.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa ichchin mukul asuntsana muuzida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luqa. 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Waha. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesuusa hyanide bazito si7ide wode gongge gelii yinna bestippa fettii geema bessa faas qitida. Asuntsi yinno si7i katamappa denddii tohera eza kaallida. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Yesuusa gonggeppa wodhdhii gaama asuntsana bi7i unttis yiqsinttida. Un gidda yeze hyargginttizuntsana fatstsida.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Sa7ita ugurodera Yesuusa tamaaruntsi eego shiiqii, «Hyanna besita akko baayze ganas bessi, sa7itan qammida. Yinnii gisho, kale yeze kara gancce hyanggi faas katstsa wonggode fana asuntsana dakko» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yezin Yesuusa unttago, «Asuntsi qitodes beezoos; un mo7odebaz yin inggote» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Un mahi, «Nuura hyanne ichchin boorappan lam77i moloppa melle baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Ezin, «Ane yezanno hyankka ko7ote» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Mahi, worzhito maatalla bettode fana ohida. Ichchin booriton lam77i moltto ekkii, salo bi7i galatii maaqqii, booritippa baxxi fa tamaaruntsis inggida; un mahi asuntsis inggida. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Ubbuntsi mu7i mizhida. Unttin mu7in attide taphpho lam77i leemate dentsida. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Katsito muyde asuntsi maachuntsin na7untsin attin ichchin mukul maaqqane.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hyaatsalla afa yedhdhida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar. 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Waha. 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Ellisii Yesuusa tamaaruntsi gongge gelii faappa tiinii abbappa seko fintsi fiinggode fana kiittii faas asuntsana moyzodes suub attida. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Asuntsana moyzii maaqqii faas woossodes fettii derella afa kezida. Sa7ita qammin E faas yeyga gam7ida. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Ye wode gonggize abballa sa7appa eerats kilo mitire hyanggizin tiino zalara gote denddii zuluntta gonggiza un7itsida.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Wontimaatsella Yesuusa abballa yedhdhitera fa tamaaruntsago yi7ida. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>E tamaaruntsi, E abballa yedhdhitera unttago yi7izanno bi7i zhashtida. Unttin, «Hyay meeshe» ga7i zhashtii uukkida.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Yezin Yesuusa ellisii, «Akkon baaya! zhashtippete! Tana» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Phexiroosa eego, «Laatstso, nena maaqqiko, taanii hyaatsitilla afa yedhdhii neego hyanggode fana tana kiitto» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yesuusa Phexiroosago, «hyankka yo7o» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Phexiroosan gonggizeppa wodhdhii hyaatsitilla afa yedhdhitera Yesuusago hyangge aykkida. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Yezin wolqqaama gote bi7i zhashtida. Hyaatsitan qoodhdhe aykkide wode «Laatstso, tana ashshoya» yaga7i uukkida.<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Yesuusa ellisii fa kushito dakkii eza aykkii, «Naate, ammano faccidayo akkos so7e» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Yesuusaran Phexiroosara gongge gelide wode gotita si7i gayda. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Gonggite yeze E tamaaruntsi, «Ne turii Xooz Na7a» ga7i goynida.<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Un abba fiinggi Gensareexe gade yellida. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Yinna gadite yeze asuntsi Yesuusa eride wode fa kara gancce yeze gutute ubbanne kiita dakkida. Asuntsi hyargginttizuntsana ubba eego ki7ida. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Hyargginttizuntsi E afula gaxito xalaala bochchode fana woossida. Bochchide ubbuntsi faxida.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Adunts wogabaz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar. 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Yinnippa suuba, fettii fettii Farisaawuntsin higge asttamaaruntsi Yerusalaameppa Yesuusago yi7i, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>«Ne tamaaruntsi akkos nu adunts wogito mentse? Un katstsa ma7adeppa tiino fa kushito meecinttoos» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yin, yin woga gisho Xoozze kiita folizanno akkos ixxe? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Akkos gayko, Xoozii, ‹Ne adayan ne intto bonchcho. E fa adaya woy fa intto cazhize hyayqo gayka?› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Yezin yin, fettii asi fa adaya woy fa intto maaddodebaz yezin, ‹Yin taappa denggize maadito Xoozzes zharshida gayko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Keze 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Mahe 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Keze 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Leewe 20:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>Fa adaya woy intto bonchchodes beezoos› yagaane. Yezin yin, yin woga folodes Xoozze qaala mentsane. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Yin, cubbuntso, Isayaasa yin baz likke ohida,<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>«‹Hyantsi asuntsi tana fa doontte bonchchane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">Yezin un wozuntta taappa hyaako yene.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Asuntsi tana cer goynane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">un asi medhdhide woga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">Xoozze higge aazizi tamaarssane› gayda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asi tunize baz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mar. 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Yesuusa gaama asuntsana faago xeegii, «Si7ote! Qoppote! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Asi tunize baz doonara gelizebaz baayzin doonappa kezze baz» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa tamaaruntsi eego yi7i, «Farisaawuntsi ne gaydanno si7i dhubunttidanno erane?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Yezin Yesuusa unttis mahi, «Salo yeze ta aday tukkikaayze minxa ubba shodinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Unbaz ashshii ashshote; un qooqe kaalisize qooquntsana. Qooqe qooqe kaalitsiko, lam77untsin gaga qitane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Phexiroosa mahi, «Yinna aazize bilitsito nuus ohoya» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Luqa. 6:39</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Yinttisin hyanno yellodes gelikaane? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Doonara gelidebaz ubba saza gelii bale kezizanno erosite? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Yezin doonara kezze baz wozinappa kezane. Asi tunize baz yentsesana. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Unttin as wozina giddappa kezize iita qofa, wodhe, olale, gome woy7e, kayzo, worddo markkidhe, cashshi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Maato. 12:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Yentsesana aazize bazita asi tunizanep attin meeccinttikaayze kushera muuzanna tunizoos» gayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fettii maachiti ammano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar. 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa yeygappa kezii Xiroosan Sidoona katama qitida. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Fettii Kanaane sa7a maachita Yesuusago yi7i, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Laatstso, Dawute na7ayo, taas yiqsinttoya; ta naato tuna ayyaana aykkii iita waytsane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Yezin Yesuusa fettii qaala mahikaaya si7i gayda. Yesuusa tamaaruntsi eego yi7i, «Hyanna maachita nu suubito kaallii wuyssane. Yinnii gisho, ne izo moyzoya» yaga7i woossida.<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Taanii wudeppa dhabide duruntsana Isra7eele keetstsappa dhabide asunts xalaalas kiitinttida» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Yezin iza, E tiintte bunqqunttii, «Laatstso, tana maaddoya?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>E mahi, «Na7unts katstsa ekkii kanuntsis olzanna lo77o baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Maachitan, «Laatstso, yinna turo, yezin melle atto yezin kanuntsi fa laatstsuntsi muuzin, leematippa wodhdhize gufa muune» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Hyanna maachite, ne ammantta damma; ne koydanni fana nees hyano» yagayda. I naata iira faxii attida.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa gaama hyargginttizuntsana fatstsida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesuusa yinnippa denddii Galila Abba kale hyanggida. Fettii derella afa kezii, ize bettida. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Gaama asuntsi, wobbuntsana, qooquntsana, kuunniduntsana, doona muumuntsana, melle gaama hyargganchchuntsana ekkii, eego ki7i E tiintte gaddida. Yesuusa unttana fatstsida. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Yinnii gisho, muumuntsi ohinttizin, guundduntsi luulezin, wobbuntsi yedhdhizin, qooquntsi be7izin asuntsi bi7i gaama qoppida, Isra7eele Xoozza galatida.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa oyddii mukul asuntsana muuzida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mar. 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsana faago xeegii, «Hyantsi gaama asuntsi taara hyaydzdzii qamma gam7ide gishon unttis hyatte muuze baz baayze gisho taanii unttis yiqsinttane. Un oge labbii gol7aame fana akko muuzikaayzara unttana hyarii dakkodes koyoos» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>E tamaaruntsi mahi, «Nuunii hyanna akko baayze sa7a hyannii fana yeze asuntsis maaqqade katstsa anappa denggode?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Yinttis wantsi boora yeze?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Un mahi, «laappun booriton yishsha eerats molo yene» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Yesuusa asuntsana sa7alla bettote fana kiittida. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Yinnippa suuba, yinna laappun booriton moluntsana ekkii Xooz galatida. Baxxi fa tamaaruntsis inggida. E tamaaruntsi asuntsis gishida.<verse eid="MAT 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Asuntsin ubba mu7i mizhida. Unttin, mu7in attide gufa laappun leemate kumutsi dentsida. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Muyde asuntsi maachan na7an faydinttikaayzin dhiiratsi xalaala oyddii mukul. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Yesuusa asuntsana dakkideppa suuba gongge gelii Magedoona sa7a qitida.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Malla be7ades oocide oochchi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar. 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luqa. 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Farisaawuntsin Saduqaawuntsi Yesuusago yi7ida. Eza fattanodes koyi, fana saloppa malla beezo ga7i oocida. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Yezin E unttago, «Sa7a ugurize wode ‹Salo zoqqide gisho wontta awoda› yagaane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Maato. 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luqa. 11:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Wonttize wode, ‹Salo zoqqii dhonidhide gisho ira bukkoda› yagaane. Yeezin yin salo malla bi7i erane, Yezin wode malla erodes dandda7ikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Iitan ammaninttoose yeletuntsi malla koyane. Yezin unttis Yoonasa mallappa melle malla ingginttoos» yagayda. Yinnippa suuba, unttana ize ashshii melle bessa qitida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Maato. 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luqa. 11:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farasawuntsin Saduqaawuntsi irshsho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar. 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Un abbap gode fintsa fiinggide wode daabbo ekkii yo7odanno botida. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Farisaawuntsappan Saduqaawuntsi irshshoppa naaginttote» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Unttin fa gidda, «E yinno gaydanna nu daabbo ekkii yi7ikaayze gisho maaqqada» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luqa. 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesuusa un qoftto erii, «Yin, ammano faccezuntso! Daabbo ekkanxi yi7ide gisho wol gidda akkos ohintte? ga7i oocida. <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Hyatten yin tiirostte? Ichchin mukul asuntsi ichchin beshe boora gishidannon un mu7i mizhin yin wantsi leemate kumutsi dentsezako botidate? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Yinnii gaaran, laappun boora oyddii mukul asuntsis gishidanno un mu7i mizhin, yin wantsi leemate kumutsi dentsezako tiirostte?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:17">Maato. 14:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Yikke, taanii Farisaawuntsin Saduqaawuntsi irshshoppa naaginttote ga7i ohizanna daabbo baz maaqqoosanno tiirostte?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:34">Maato. 15:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Yeezin, E tamaaruntsi Yesuusa ohize buka dentsodes olinttize irshshobaz maaqqikaayzin Farisaawuntsin Saduqaawuntsi timirtteppa naaginttode fana maaqqidanno tiirida.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa Yesuusa baz ohida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar. 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luqa. 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yesuusa Qisaariya Filphoosa sa7a yellide wode fa tamaaruntsago, «Asuntsi, As Na7aya oona ga7e?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Un, «Fete fete Xammaqize Wahannisa, melluntsi Eeliyaasa mahi hyankkuntsi Ermmiyasa woy nabuntsappa feta gaane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yeezin, yin tana oona ga7ete?» ga7i unttana oocida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Maato. 14:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simoon Phexiroosa mahi, «Neenii Kiristtoosa, de7o Xoozze na7a» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesuusa Phexiroosago, «Yoona na7a Simoona, ne anjjinttidaya! Hyanno nees qonccizide salo yeze ta adayap attin asi baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Waha. 6:68</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Ta nees ohine Phexiroosa, ne lalla! Taanii hyay lallizella afa ta woosa keetstsi keexxoda. Gaaname wolqqan izo gamoos. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Salo ka7itumo qulfe ta nees inggoda. Sa7a ne accidebaz ubba salo Xoozze kale acinttidebaz maaqqada. Sa7a ne billide baz ubba salo Xoozze kale bilinttidebaz maaqqada» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Yinnippa suuba, E, Kiristtoosa maaqqidanno oodesin ohaame fana fa tamaaruntsis mintsii kiittida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Maato. 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Waha. 20:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fana yellode madhito ohida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Yinna woditippa dentsii Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsis, «Taanii Yerusalaame hyanggodes beezane. Yeyga worzha cimuntsi, kahinunts hyalaquntsin higge asttamaarunts kushe madha ekkodes beezane. Un tana wodhoda, Yezin taanii hyaydzintsa qamma hyayqoppa denddoda» yaga7i qonccizida.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Phexiroosa Yesuusa gaxa kessii, «Laatstso, Yinnii fana yeze baz nena mulon yellippe!» yaga7i kaccida.<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Yesuusa Phexiroosago suub maaqqii, «Hyay xalahizayo, taappa hyaako! Neenii as qofa qoppanep attin Xoozze qofa qoppoosse gisho taas dhube maaqqane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago, «Ooden tana kaallodes koyze baz maaqqiko fana kaddo, fa masqaltto tookkii tana kaallo. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Fa shemppito ashshodes koyze ubbuntsi dhabsoda. Yezin fa shemppito ta gisho ga7i aatsii inggize ashshoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Maato. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luqa. 14:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Asi alame kumutsi fa baz mahi, fa shemppito dhabsiko eza akko maadde? Woy asi fa shemppito wozodes akki inggodes dandda7e?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Maato. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luqa. 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Waha. 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>As na7a fa aday bonchchora fa kiitanchchuntsara yo7oda. Ye wode fettii fettii atstses E oochchiti fana inggoda. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Ta turo ohine; as Na7a fa ka7itumo bonchchora maaqqii yo7odera be7ade wontsis hyanne eqqide asuntsappa hyayqqaamuntsi yene» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Maato. 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maz. 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rome 2:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa bishshita laaminttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar. 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luqa. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Izippun qammappa suuba Yesuusa, Phexiroosa, Yayqooban E isha Wahannisa faara ekkii unttana xalaala derella afa kezida. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Ize un tiintte Yesuusa bishshita laaminttida; E sinttan awa fana focida. E afulttan loytsii booxxida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Phex. 1:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Yikke, Musen Eliyaasan eera ohinttizin bi7ida. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Phexiroosa Yesuusago, «Laatstso Nuunii hyanne dhuga yi7ida. Ne koyko feta nees, feta Muses, feta Eliyaasas hyanne hyaydzdzii gaabba gaabboda» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Phexiroosa yinno hyaga ohizin bootsi focide dhonne unttana goozida. Dhonttii giddara, «Tana ufayssize, ta kadhize na7ay hyaya, eza si7ote!» yagaaze qaala yi7ida. <verse eid="MAT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>E tamaaruntsi yinno si7ide wode tannii fa sinttira sa7alla gol7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Medho 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato. 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luqa. 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Mahe 18:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Yezin Yesuusa unttago shiiqii unttana bochchii, «Denddote, zhashtippete!» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Un dhoqi ga7i be7ize wode Yesuusappa melle oonan biikaaya.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Un derizeppa wodhdhizin Yesuusa unttago, «As Na7a hyayqoppa denddode wontsis hyanno yin bi7idanno oodesin ohippete» ga7i kiittida. <verse eid="MAT 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsi, «Yeezin, higge asttamaaruntsi Eeliyaasa Kiristtoosappa tiino yo7oda gaydanna akkoso?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yee! Eeliyaasa tiino yi7i ubba baz giigizoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Yezin ta yinttis turo ohine; Eeliyaasa tiino yi7ida. Unttin eella afa koydebaz oochchidap attin eza shaakkii erikaaya. Yinnii gaar As Na7a un kushe madha ekkoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Ye wode Yesuusa gaydanna Xammaqize Wahannisa baz maaqqidanno tiirida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Maato. 11:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa tuna ayyaana aykkide na7aya fatstsida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar. 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luqa. 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Un derizeppa asuntsago maaqqize wode fettii asi Yesuusa tiintte bunqqunttii, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>«Laatstso, aade ta na7aya maaroya; eza guuddii olize hyargge gaama wode un7itsi taman hyaatsan olane. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Ne tamaaruntsago ki7ida, Yezin un fatstsodes dandda7ikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yin, ammanoose wobbo yeletuntso ayde yellodes ta yinttara yessade? Ayde yellodes ta yinttana dandda7ode? Ane na7aya hyankka ekkii yo7ote» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesuusa tuna ayyaaniza qoddin, tuna ayyaanize na7ayppa kezida; yinna saate na7ay faxida. <verse eid="MAT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa tamaaruntsi fa faas eego shiiqii, «Nu tuna ayyaaniza kessodes dandda7ikaayzanna akkoso?» yaga7i oocida. <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>E unttago, «Yinttis ammano eeride gishos. Ta yinttis turo ohine; gaashe aafe fana ammano yinttis yeziko ‹Hyay deriza hyannippa denddii gode aadho› gayko yinttis kiitinttoda. Yinttis dandda7inttoose baaya. <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>[Yezin yinnii gaarize woosaran xoomarapp attin hyarii kezoos]» yagayda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii zaga maxaafite faydo 21 baaya.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa hyayqitibaz mahi ohida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar. 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luqa. 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsi Galila shiiqii yezin Yesuusa unttago hyanna folinttodes beezane, «As Na7ay as kushe aadhii ingginttoda. <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>Un eza wodhoda, Yezin E hyaydzdzintsa qamma hyayqoppa denddoda» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">E tamaaruntsi gaama azzanida.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze keetstsi giira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Yesuusaran E tamaaruntsara Qifirnahoome katama yellide wode Xoozze keetstsa giira gachchizuntsi Phexiroosago yi7i, «Yin asttamaarize Xoozze keetstsi giira lam77i dinaare giiroso?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Phexiroosa mahi, «Giirane» yagayda. Phexiroosa keetstsa gelize wode Yesuusa tiinidhii, «Phexiroosa, nees akko aaze? Hyanna sa7a ka7itumo qaraxen giira ooppa ekke? Gade asappa woy as gade asappa?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye wode ka7itumtta fa gade asuntsappa giira ekkosi.</char></note> yaga7i oocida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Keze 30:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Phexiroosa «As gade asappa» ga7i mahida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesuusa mahi, «Yeezako gade asuntsi giira giroos ga7e. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Yezin un dhubunttaame fana abba hyanggi molo aykkize manxxako olo. Tiino ne aykkize molize doona bugii giiras maaqqize oyddii dinaare ne gishon ta gisho ekkii kanggi giiro» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Ubbappa aadhize oode?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luqa. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Ye wode Yesuusa tamaaruntsi yi7i, «Salo ka7itumo ubbappa aadhize oode?» yaga7i oocida. <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesuusa fettii eeratsi na7a xeegii un gidda essi hyannii fana yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luqa. 22:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>«Taanii yinttis turo ohine; yin laaminttanxiko eerats na7unts fana yi7anxiko salo ka7itumo mulon gelodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Yikke, hyanna eerats na7unts gaar fana kawushize ooden salo ka7itumo ubbappa aadhiza maaqqoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:15">Mar. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Luqa. 18:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Hyay fana na7a ta suntsite mokkize ooden tana mokkane.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>«Yezin tana ammanze hyanna eeratsuntsappa feta nagara oochchode fana dhube maaqqize ooden damma gaachi woxa fa afurtte accii ciimmo abba olinttizako ees lo77o. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Alame gidda asi nagara oochchode fana oochchizuntsi yeze gisho alamito bade. Yinnii fana yeze baz yi7ikaayzara attoos, yezin dhube E baggar ye7ize atstsa bade.<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>«Ne kushize woy ne tohize nena balitsiko neeppa gachchii olo. Ne lam77i kushera woy lam77i tohera medhina tama olinttodeppa kushe woy tohe duuxa maaqqii de7o yeziko nees lo77o. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Mahi ne aafize nena balitsiko woocii kessii alla olo. Ne lam77i aafera gaanname tama olinttodeppa fettii aafera de7o yeziko nees lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Maato. 5:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>«Ta yinttis ohine; salo yeze unttana naagize kiitanchchuntsi ubba wode salo yeze ta Aday tiino yeze gisho yin hyanna eeratsuntsappa fetaya leqqaame fana naaginttote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Maato. 5:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>As Na7a dhabiduntsana ashshodes yi7ida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">Luqa. 19:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhabide duro aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luqa. 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>Mahi Yesuusa, «Yinttis akko aaze? Fettii atstses xeet duro yezuntsappa fetay dhabiko uddufun tam uddufununtsana derella olii ashshii ye dhabidaya koyodes qitosaane? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Ta turo ohine; E denggide wode uddufun tam uddufununtsappa aatsii dhabii benttide fettii durizera ufayttane. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Yinnii fana, salo yeze yin aday hyanna eeratsuntsappa fetay dhabode fana koyoos.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qohide asi wayssade?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>«Ne ishay nena qohiko ne xalaala eego hyanggi E baltto ees oho. E nena si7iko ne ishaya nees ishe maho. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Yezin E nena si7anxi ixxiko, lam77i woy hyaydzdzii asi markkara ohita latstsinttize gisho fettii woy lam77i asi ekkii eego hyanggo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luqa. 17:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>E unttana si7anxiko, woosa keetstsa oho. Woosa keetstsi gaazebaz si7anxiko ammanoose asi fana woy qaraxe gachchize asi fana eza faydo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Mahe 19:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>«Ta yinttis turo ohine; sa7alla yin accidebaz ubba salo accinttidebaz maaqqada. Sa7alla yin billide baz ubba salo bilinttidebaz maaqqada.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>«Mahi ta yinttis ohine; sa7alla yinttappa lam77untsi fa woossize baz fettii wozina maaqqii Xooz woossize baz maaqqiko salo yeze ta aday yinttis oochchoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Maato. 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Waha. 20:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Tana kaallizuntsappa lam77i woy hyaydzdzii maaqqii shiiqize bessa taanii un gidda benttoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atto ga7ebaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Ye wode Phexiroosa Yesuusago yi7i, «Laatstso, ta ishay tana qohiko wantsi tohe taanii atto ga7odes beeze? Laappun tohe yellodesine?» ga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ade, laappun tam tohe laappunap attin laappun tohe xalaala baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3-4">Luqa. 17:3-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>«Yinnii gisho, salo ka7itumo faas oochchizuntsara fa miishita faccezakon gujunttezako be7ades qoppide kaatiza aazane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:24">Medho 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Ye kaatize miishita faccezakon gujunttezako be7ize wode gaama gale yeze fettii atstsa eego ki7ida. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Yezin ye arize galtto ciggodes gamin eeran, E machchitira, E na7untsara eesi yeze baz ubba bayzintti galtta ciginttode fana laatstse kiittida. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Yeezin arize fa laatstse tohitilla gol7i, ‹Aade eerats wode gam7o, ta galtto ubba ta ciggoda› yaga7i woossida. <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>E laatstsize ees yiqsintti, dakkii ashshida; E aciton maarida.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>«Yezin ye arize kezii hyanggi faas lagge mahiduntsappa fetaya faappa eerats miishe tal7idaya, ‹Neella afa yeze ta miishito taas ciggo› ga7i afurtto aykkida.<verse eid="MAT 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>«E laggize arize E tiintte bunqquntti, ‹Aade eerats wode gam7o taanii ta acito ubba ciggoda› yaga7i woossida.<verse eid="MAT 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>«Yezin ixxii ekkii kanggi fa laggize acito ciggode wontsis achi keetstsa geltsida. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Yinnii gisho, melle laggizes oochchizuntsi yinno bi7ide wode gaama zhilidhdhida, hyanggi fa laatstses E oochchide bazito ubba ohida.<verse eid="MAT 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>«Yeezin laatstse ye ariza xeegizi, ‹Hyay iita arzayo, ne tana woosside gisho ta ne acito ubba nees maarida. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Yeezin, ta ne acito maaridanni fana ne ne lagge maaqqide arize acito maarodes nena beezoso?› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Yinnii gisho, laatstse gaama zhilidhdhi, E fa acito ubba ciggode wontsis un7inttode fana achi keetstsa olida.<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>«Yinnii fana, yin fete fete yin isha wozinappa maaranxiko salo yeze ta Aday yinttana yinnii fana oochchoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Ekken gele baz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar. 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesuusa yinno ohi hyaasidannippa suuba Galilappa denddii Yorddaanosa borkkappa seko zala yeze yihuda sa7a qitida. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Gaama asuntsi eza kaallii hyanggin E fatstsida.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Farisaawuntsi eza fattanodes koyi eego yi7i, «Fettii asi akko baggaran fa machchito dakkodes beeze?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Xoozii tiino dhiiratsin maachon mahi medhdhidanno yin nabbabikate? <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>‹Yinnii gisho, Fettii asi fa adayan fa intto ashshii fa machchitira fetto maaqqane, lam77untsin fettii asho maaqqane.›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Medho 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:1">5:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Yinnii gisho, un fettii asho maaqqanep attin lam77i maaqqoos. Yikke, Xoozii accidanno asi shaakkippe» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Medho 2:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Farisaawuntsi, «Yeezin, Muse fettii asi dafo warqqate inggi dakkode fana akkos kiittido?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yesuusa Mahi, «Yin, yin machchuntsana dakkode fana Muse yinttis gaydanna, yin wozina mintsiti gishop attin tiinoppa yinnii gaar baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:1">Medho 24:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Ta yinttis ohine; fa machchito gome wayinttikaayzin dakkii melle ekkize ooden olalida» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>E tamaaruntsi eego, «Azinii bazin machchi bazi yinnii gaar maaqqiko ekken gelen attiko lo77o» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Maato. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Qoro. 7:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Yesuusa Mahi, «Yinnii gaarize timirtte Xoozii dandda7a inggiduntsis fattin as ubbuntsis baaya. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Yikke, yelinttitera ashttime maaqqii yelinttiduntsi yene, mahi asi qaaratiduntsi yene, mahi salo ka7itumo gisho ga7i fana ashttime mahiduntsi yene. Yinnii gisho, hyanno ekkodes dandda7ize ooden ekko» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa eerats na7untsana anjjida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar. 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luqa. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Yesuusa fa kushito eerats na7untsalla gaddii unttis woossode fana fettii fettii asuntsi na7untsana eego ki7ida. Yezin E tamaaruntsi asuntsana kaccida. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Yezin Yesuusa, «Salo ka7itumo hyantses fana yezuntsis maaqqide gisho eeratsi na7untsi taago ye7izanno kayppete; yo7o ga7ote» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Fa kushito unttalla gaddidannippa suuba yinna bestippa ashshii qitida.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Na7atits dure atstsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar. 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luqa. 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Fettii qamma fettii atstse Yesuusago yi7i, «Asttamaarzayo, taanii medhina de7o denggodes akko lo77o baz oochcho?» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesuusa eego, «Lo77o bazis ne tana akkos ooce? Fettii Xoozzap attin melle lo77o baaya. Yezin ne medhina de7o ekkodes koyiko kiitto naago» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Atstse mahi, «Aanno kiitta» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesuusa mahi, «Wodhippe, olalippe, kaystippe, worddo markkidhippe, <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>Ne adayan ne intto bonchcho, asi ubba ne fana kadho» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-16">Keze 20:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-20">Mahe 5:17-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Ye shakanize, «Taanii hyanno ubba na7atitsappa dentsi naagida. Yeezin, melle taas faccide baz akko bazo?» yaga7i oocida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Keze 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Mahe 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leewe 19:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Ne folo maaqqodes koyko hyanggi nees yeze baz bayzi dahuntsis inggo; ne salo duretitsi denggoda. Yeyzi maaqqii yi7i tana kaallo» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Yezin ye shakanize gaama dure maaqqide gisho yinno si7ide wode azzanitera ashshii qitida. <verse eid="MAT 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsana, «Ta yinttis turo ohine; dure salo ka7itumo gelodanna gaama madha. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Dure asi Xoozze ka7itumo gelodannippa gimale marppe uruntsara aadhizanna laafa» yagayda. <figure style="fig" alt="Man leading unloaded camel" file="LB00039B.TIF" size="span" ref="19:24">Gimale Gochchane </figure><verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Yesuusa tamaaruntsi yinno si7i gaama qoppii, «Yeezin, oode attodes dandda7ode?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesuusa unttana dakkii bi7i, «Hyanna asis dandda7inttoos, yezin Xoozis ubbanna dandda7inttane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Phexiroosa mahi, «Nuunii ubba baz ashshii nena kaallida. Yeezin, nu akko denggode?» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesuusa unttago hyannii gaar yagayda: «Taanii yinttis turo ohine; As na7ay yo7ode kille alamite fa bonchcho araatalla bettize wode yin taphpho lam77untsi, tana kaalliduntsi, taphpho lam77i araatalla bettii taphpho lam77i Isra7eele bagguntsalla afa firddoda. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Ta suntsiti gisho keetsito woy ishuntsana woy mishuntsana woy adaya woy intto woy na7untsana woy gadito ashshide ooden xeet kushe ekkoda. Mahi medhina de7o ekkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Maato. 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Luqa. 22:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Yezin gaamuntsi hyatte yestte tiino maaqqiduntsi suuba maaqqoda, mahi suuba maaqqiduntsi tiino maaqqoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Woyne gidda oochchize asunts aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>«Salo ka7itumo fa woyne gidda oocizuntsis kira inggodes wontta gooda kezide karttii adaya aazane. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>E oochchizuntsis hyayno hyayno fettii dinaare<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dinaare: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii asi fettii qamma oochchii feezhii ekkize miishe.</char></note> inggodes unttara giigii, unttana fa woyne gidda dakkida.<verse eid="MAT 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>«Mahi wonttappa hyaydzdzii saate maaqqizin kezii oocha dhabin gabe bessa eqqide melle asuntsana denggida. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>E unttago, ‹Yinttin ta woyne gidda hyanggi oochchote, taanii yinttis tana lo77ide miishe inggoda› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Unttin hyanggida. Mahi E izipun saateran uddufun saatera kezii yinnii fana oochchida. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Taphpho fettii saate maaqqizin E kezize wode melluntsana yeyga eqqiduntsana denggi, ‹Yin oocha billii awara feesho hyanne akkos eqqii feezhidote? yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>«Un mahi, ‹Nuna kira oocize asi dhabide gisho› yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:7">«Ezin, ‹Yinttin ta woyne gidda hyanggi oochchote› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>«Saata ugurin, woyne aday oochchizunts hyalaqizego, ‹Oochchizuntsana xeegii lassa oocha geliduntsappa dentsii tiino geliduntsana yellodes un miishito inggo› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Taphpho fettii saater oocha aykkiduntsin yi7i, omma omma fettii fettii dinaare ekkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Leewe 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Mahe 24:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Tiino oocha aykkiduntsi yi7i, faas gaama ingginttoda ga7i qoppida. Yezin unttin omma omma fettii fettii dinaare ekkida. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Fa miishito ekkii maaqqii karttii adaylla afa zuuzinggida. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>‹Hyantses suubappa yi7i fettii saate xalaala oochchida. Yezin awara feesho labbii feezhide nuura un wayzi fetto maaqqe› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>«Woyne ataakilte aday oochchizuntsappa fetaygo, ‹Ta ishayo, ta nena qohikaaya; ne taara wulidhdhidanna fettii dinaares baane? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Ne miishito ekkii ne kara qito. Ta ugure yi7idesin neenii fana inggodes koyane. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Taanii ta miishitira koydebaz oochchodes taas adetits wolqqa baane? Woy ta dalgga maaqqide gisho ne qinaatane?› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>«Yinnii gaaran hyatte de7ite suub maaqqiduntsi tiinoda, tiiniduntsi mahi suuboda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Maato. 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar. 10:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luqa. 13:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa hyayqiti baz hyaydzdzintsa ohida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luqa. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Yesuusa Yerusalaame hyanggitera, taphpho lam77i tamaaruntsana dumma gaxa kessii unttago yagayda: <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>«Yikke, nuunii hyatte Yerusalaame hyanggella afa yene. Ize as na7a kahinunts hyalaquntsisin higge asttamaaruntsis aatsii ingginttoda. Unttin eella afa hyayqo firdda firddoda. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Eza Ayhude maaqqoosse worzhas aatsii inggoda. Un eza kawushshoda, garaafoda, yeyzi eza masqlalla afa suxxoda. Yezin E hyaydzintsa qamma hyayqoppa denddoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zabdoosa na7unts intti woosa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar. 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Ye wode zabdoosa machchita fa lam77i dhiiratsi na7untsara Yesuusago yi7i, E tiino bunqqunttii fettii baz eza woossida.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesuusa iigo, «Ne akko koye?» gayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Iza mahi, «Ne ka7itumtte hyantsi ta lam77i na7untsi fetaya nees mizaqi zala fetaya nees workkita zala betto ga7oya!» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Yezin Yesuusa unttago mahi, «Yin akko woossizako eroos; taanii ushshades yeze madha xuu7uto ushshades dandda7ode?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Unttin, «Yee dandda7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesuusa, «Turo taanii ushshades yeze xuu7uto yin ushshada. Yezin ta mizaqiten workkite bettoduntsana doorize tana baaya. Yinna besita ingginttize, ta aday inggodes giigizide asuntsis» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Attide taphphi E tamaaruntsi yinno si7ide wode lam77i ishuntsana kaccida. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Yezin Yesuusa unttana ubba xeegii hyannii gaar yagayda. «Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsana ahizuntsii fa asuntsalla laatsidhizannon unttana kaalitsizuntsi mahi unttana adetitsi wolqqara ahizanno yin erane. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Yezin yin gidda yinnii gaar maaqqippe. Yinttappa dhoqqodes koyze ooden yinttis aro maaqqe. <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>Yin gidda ubbappa dhoqqa maaqqodes koyze ooden yinttis aro maaqqodes beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Maato. 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar. 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luqa. 22:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Yinnii fanan, As Na7a as maaddodesin gaama asuntsana wozodes fa shemppito inggodes yi7idap attin asara maaddinttodes yi7ikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa lam77i qooquntsana fatstsida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar. 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luqa. 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsara Iyaarkkoppa kezii hyanggizin, gaama asuntsi unttana kaallida. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Oge gaxa bettide lam77i qooquntusi Yesuusa yeygara aadhizanno si7i, «Laatstso, Dawute na7ayo, nuna maaroya» yaga7i uukkida. <verse eid="MAT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Gaama asuntsi unttana, «Hyayzote» yaga7i kaccida. Yezin un, «Laatstso, Dawute na7ayo, nuna maaroya» ga7i gujjii uukkida.<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesuusa eqqii, unttana xeegii, «Ta yinttis akki yissade fana koyete?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Unttin, «Laatstso, nu aafita be7ade gaar koyane» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Yesuusa unttis yiqsinttii, un aafto bochchida. Ellisii un aafita bi7ida; unttin eza kaallida.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa damma bonchchora Yerusalaame gelida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luqa. 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Waha. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Yesuusaran E tamaaruntsara Yerusalaame ukkii, Shamahe derizella yeze beetefaage gaaze gutute yellitera, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsappa lam77untsana faappa tiino hyanggote ga7i kiittida: <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>«Yinttappa tiino yeze gutute hyanggote. Yeyga fettii hyare achcha yezanno I na7itira yin denggoda. Unttana billii taago ekkii yo7ote. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Ooden yinttana oociko, ‹Laatstsii unttana koyane› yaga7ote. E unttana elle mahoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Yinnan nabize,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>«Xiyoone katamas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">‹Yikke, ne kaatize aada maaqqii, hyartillan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">hyariti na7itilla bettii, neego ye7ine› ga7ote»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:5">ga7i xaafinttidanna folinttode gaar yinna hyanida.<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>E tamaaruntsi hyanggi Yesuusa unttana kiittidanni fana oochchida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zakka. 9:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Hyarton hyartti na7iton ki7i kattara fa ma7ito un bantte gaddida. Yesuusa ma7itilla afa bettida. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Gaama asunts fa ma7ito ogite yiixxida. Melluntsi tashe tarshii ogite olida. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Yesuusappa tiinora hyanggizuntsin eeppa suubara kaallizuntsi gaama asuntsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">«Hosaana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hosaana: </char><char style="ft">Ibraysxe doonara hosaana gaazanna «Nuna ashsho» ga7e. Mahi asuntsi Xoozza galatodes maaddinttize qaala.</char></note> Dawute na7ay galatintto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Laatstse suntsite yi7ize anjjnttidaya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:9">Bonchcho Ubbappa Dhoqqa Salo Xoozis maaqqe!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:9">yaga7i uukkida.<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Yesuusa Yerusalaame katama gelide wode yinna katamite yeze asunts ubbuntsi, «Hyay oode?» yaga7i turtuurida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Maz. 118:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Asuntsi, «Hyay Galila yeze Naazirete katamappa yi7ide nabe Yesuusa» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsa gelida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luqa. 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Waha. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsa gelii, yeyga baayzuntsanan wonggizuntsana ubba bale bay7ida. Miishe laamizuntsana xarpheziton wolle bayzize oydito shirii olida. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Ezin unttago, «Xoozze qaaltte, ‹Ta keetsita Xooz woossize keetstsi ga7inttane› ga7intti xaafinttida. Yezin yin faanno aachinttize wom7o mahidate» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsa yessadera qooquntsin wobbuntsi eego yi7in unttana fatstsida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Er. 7:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Yezin kahinunts hyalaquntsin higge asttamaaruntsi Yesuusa oochchide gaama qofize bazito bi7idannen zhooga na7untsi Xoozze keetstsa, «Dawute na7ay, galatintto» yaga7i uukkizanno si7i kaccida. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Un Yesuusago, «Hyantses gaazanno ne si7ine?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesuusa, «Yee si7ine, Xoozze qaaltte, ‹Zhooga na7unts doontten dhanggize na7unts doontte galata giigizane› ga7intti xaafinttidanno yin nabbabikate?» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Unttana yeyga ashshii Bitaaniya katama hyanggi aqida.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laatstsii baaddide belese minxito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar. 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Yesuusa wontta gooda katama maaqqii yi7itera naydhdhida. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Oge gaxa fettii belese minxa bi7i iigo hyanggida. Yezin hyayep attin melle akkon denggikaaya. Yinnii gisho, izo, «Yikkeppa lam7intsa aafe aafippe!» yagayda. Yinna belese minxita ellisii melii attida.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>E tamaaruntsi yinno bi7i, «Hyanna belesita wayzi ellisii melido?» yaga7i gaama qoppida.<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Taanii yinttis turo ohine; yinttis ammano yeziko, mahi yin sidhanxiko belesitilla taanii oochchidanni fana xalaala oochchoos, yezin ‹Hyay deriza shodintti abba wodhdho› yagayko hyanoda.<figure style="fig" alt="Man picking figs" file="LB00085B.TIF" size="span" ref="21:22">Atstse belese maxane </figure> <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Ammanii yin woossize baz akkon maaqqiko yin ekkoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Maato. 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Qoro. 13:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa adetits wolqqita oocinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luqa. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsa gelii tamaarssodera, kahinunts hyalaquntsin Ayhude cimuntsi eego yi7i, «Ne hyanno oochchode fana nees akko adetits wolqqa yeze? Nees hyanno adetits wolqqito inggide oode?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Taanii yinttana fettii baz oocane; yin taas yinno mahiko, taanin akko adetits wolqqara oochchizako yinttis ohoda. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Wahannisa xinqqate anappa? Xoozappane asappa?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Un fa gidda zorintti, «Nu, ‹Xoozappa› gayko, E nuna, ‹Yeezin akkos ammananxido?› yaga7oda. <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Nu, ‹Asappa› gayko, asi ubbuntsi Wahannisa nabe mahi be7ize gisho nu asuntsana zhashitane» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Yinnii gisho, «Nu eroos» yaga7i mahida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Ezin, «Yikke, taanin hyanno akko adetits wolqqara oochchizako yinttis ohoos» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lam77i na7unts aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>«Yesuusa mahi hyannii gaar yagayda: lam77i dhiiratsi na7untsi yeze fettii atstse yene. Ye atstse fettii na7aygo hyanggi, ‹Ta na7ayo, hyayno woyne gidda hyanggi oochcho› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Na7ay mahi, ‹Atto hyanggoos› yagayda. Yezin suubappa fa wozintte qoppii oochchodes hyanggida. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Aday fa hyankkay na7aygo hyanggi, fa tiino na7aygo gaydanni fana kiittida. Ezin, ‹Ye7e, ta adayo› yagayda. Yezin hyanggikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Hyantsi lam77i na7untsappa fa adays kiitinttide aayo?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Unttin, «Tiinoya» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yesuusa unttago, «Ta yinttis turo ohine; qaraxe gachchizuntsin olalizuntsi yinttappa tiinii Xoozze ka7itumtto geloda. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Xammaqize Wahannisa luule oge tamaarssitera yi7in E gaazanno ammanikaaya. Yezin qaraxe gachchizuntsin olalizuntsi ammanida. Yin melle atto yezin, unttana bi7i yin nagarttippa maaqqii ammanikaaya» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luqa. 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:29-30">7:29-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyne gidda wootizuntsi aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar. 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luqa. 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Mahi Yesuusa hyannii gaar yagayda; «Melle aazize si7ote, woyne tukkide fettii atstse yene. Ye woynize kantto wututsi gasida. Woyne cicize ollan bookkida. Woyniza naagodes shakkon shakkida. Yinnippa suuba, gadito kotstse inggi melle sa7a qitida. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Woyne aafto maxize agina yellin fana yellize baggito ekkii ko7ode gaar fa aruntsana unttago dakkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Isa. 5:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Kotstse inggide aday E aruntsana aykkii fetaya hyadhdhida, hyankkaya wodhida mahi attiduntsana shuchchara dhogida. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Woyne atakiltti aday tiinuntsappa aadhize melle aruntsana kiittida. Kotstse ekkiduntsi unttana hyankkuntsalla afa oochchidanni gaar oochchida. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Wurssutsite E, ‹Ta na7aya un bonchchoda!› yaga7i fa na7aya unttago kiittida.<verse eid="MAT 21:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>«Yezin gaditii aday na7aya bi7i wol gidda ‹Gadito laattode hyaya, eza wodhii gadito nu ekkoda!› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Na7aya aykkii woyne giditippa gaxa kessii wodhida.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>«Yikke, woyne atakiltti laatstse ye7ize wode ye kotstse ekkide aduntsana wayssade?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Un mahi, «E yentsi iita asuntsana iita wodhe wodhii, woynize aafize wode eza yellize baggito wodera wodera inggize melle asis kotstse inggoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yesuusa mahi unttago, Xoozze qaaltte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Keexxizuntsi borii ixxide shuchchize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">mayzenes omma maaqqane, ubbappa aadhize shuchchi maaqqane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">Yinno laatstsii oochchidebaz;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">nu aaftis gaama qofize baz</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:42">ga7intti xaafinttidanno nabbabikate?<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>«Yinnii gisho, taanii yinttis ohine; Xoozze ka7itumo yinttappa ekkinttii lo77o aafe aafize asuntsis ingginttoda. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Hyay shuchchizella afa gol7ize ubba meqqoda. Mahi hyay shuchchize eella afa wodhdhize atstsen gaacinttoda»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii zaga maxaafite faydo 44 gujjane (Luqasa 20:18 bo7ote) </char></note> yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz. 118:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Kahinunts hyalaquntsin Farisaawuntsi Yesuusa ohide aazizito si7ide wode fana ohidanno erida. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Un Yesuusa aykkodes koyda, yezin asuntsi Yesuusa nabe mahi be7ize gisho asuntsis zhashtida.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Zhagana xeege aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luqa. 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesuusa asuntsis mahi hyannii gaar yaga7i aazize ohida. <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>«Xoozze ka7itumo fa na7ays zhagana giigizide kaati aazane. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Ye kaatize zhagana yo7ode fana ohi gaddide asuntsana xeegodes fa aruntsana kiittida. Yezin asuntsi yo7odes koykaaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Mahi melle aruntsana xeegii, xeeginttide asuntsago hyanggi, ‹Taanii ta sangguntsanan modhdhuntsana shukkida; ubbanna giigida. Ta zhagana diggisago hyankka yo7ote ga7ote› ga7i kiittida. <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Yezin xeeginttiduntsi xeegito ixxii, fa oocha oocha qitida. Fetay fa wootas, hyankkay fa zal77e qitida. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Mellunts mahi kaat aruntsana aykkii, iissii hyadhdhii wodhida.<verse eid="MAT 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>«Kaatize gaama zhilidhdhii, fa wottaddaruntsana dakkii shemppo wodhiduntsana wodhizida, un katamito eetsida. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Yinnippa suuba, fa aruntsago, ‹Zhagantta giigida, yezin xeeginttiduntsi zhaganas beezze asi baaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Yinnii gisho, dalgga oge hyanggi, denggide asi ubba zhagana yo7ode fana xeegote› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Aruntsin ogella hyanggi faas denggide asi ubba lo77untsanan iituntsana ki7i zhagana daase geltsii kuntsida.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>«Yezin kaatize katstsa ma7ades bettide asuntsana be7ades gelide wode zhagana afula ma77ikaayze fettii asi denggida. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Eego, ‹Naate, ne zhagana afula ma77ikaayzara wayzi hyanne gelido?› yagayda. Yezin atstse si7i gayda.<verse eid="MAT 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>«Kaatize fa aruntsago, ‹Hyay atstse kushiton tohito accii, bale dhuma kessii olote. Ize yeefon achchi garccingge maaqqoda› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>«Yinnii fanan, Xoozze ka7itumos xeeginttiduntsi gaama yezin doorinttiduntsi eeratsi» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Maato. 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luqa. 13:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Giira baz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar. 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luqa. 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Yinnippa suuba, Farisaawuntsi hyanggi, Yesuusa wayzi ohera aykkod yezako zorinttida. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Fa tamaaruntsanan kaat Heroodisa bagguntsappa feta feta kiittida. Unttin, «Asttamaarzayo, ne turo ohizanno nu erane. Ne asappa as shagoos, asi woyganddes ga7i akkon oochchoos, Xoozze ogito turetitsara tamaarssane. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Ane nuus oho, nuunii Roome kaatis giira giirodes beezanen beezosa?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Yezin Yesuusa un iita qoftto erii, «Hyantsi cubbuntso, tana akkos fattanete? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Giira giirize miishe tana beezote» yagayda. Unttin ees dinaare ki7ida. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>E, «Hyays suntsitan bishshita oodeso?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Unttin, «Roome kaatays» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Yeezako Yesuusa unttago, «Yikke, kaatis beezanno kaatis, Xoozis beezanno Xoozis inggote» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Unttin yinno si7ide wode gaama qoppii E kaleppa ashshii qitida.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hyayqoppa denddebaz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luqa. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Yinna qammite hyayqoppa denddo baaya yagaaze Saduqaawuntsi Yesuusago yi7i, yaga7i eza oocida. <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>«Asttamaarzayo, ‹Muse, fettii asi na7a yelikaayzara hyayqiko, ye hyayqide ishay E machchito ekkii, fa ishays na7a yelo› yaga7i kiittida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Hawa. 23:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Nu erize laappun ishuntsi yene. Anggisse machcho ekkii na7a yelikaayzara hyayqida. E machchito E geeze mahida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Mahe 25:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Yinnii fana, ye lam7antsen, hyaydzantsen, hyanggi laappununtsa yellodes. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Ubbappa suuba yinna maachita hyayqqida. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Yeezin, laappununts ubbuntsi izo mahide gisho hyayqoppa denddize qamma, yinna maachita laappununtsappa aaye machcho maaqqade?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Yin Xoozze qaalan E wolqqito eroosse gisho balinttane. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Asuntsi hyayqoppa denddize wode salo yeze kiitanchchuntsi fana maaqqanep attin ekkosin geloos. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Mahi hyayqqide asuntsi hyayqoppa denddode baz Xoozii yinttis ohidanno nabbabikate? <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>Xoozii, ‹Taanii Abrahama Xooz, Yisaaqa Xooz, Yayqooba Xooz› yagayda. Yinnii gisho, Xoozii faxa yezunts Xoozap attin hyayqqiduntsi Xooz baaya»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuusa yinna besite ohide Xoozze hyantsi hyayqqide hyaydzdzunsis Xooz maaqqiko un de7o yene gaazanno.</char></note> yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Gaama asunts yinno si7i, E timirttite gaama qoppida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Keze 3:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubbappa tiinidhize kiita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar. 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luqa. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Yesuusa Saduqaawuntsis gawude baz dhabsidanno Farasawuntsi si7ide wode fettilla shiiqida. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Un giddappa fettii higge asttamaarize Yesuusa faatana ooce oocida. <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>«Asttamaarzayo, higge ubbappa aadhize aayya?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesuusa mahi, Ne Laatstsa, ne Xoozza, ne kumutsi wozinappa, ne kumutsi shemppoppa, ne kumutsi qofappa kadho. <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Ubbappa aadhizen tiino kiita hyanno.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Mahe 6:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Lam7intsa ubbappa aadhize kiita, as ubba ne ommito ne kadhizanni fana kadho yagaazanno. <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Muse higgen nabunts timirtte ubba hyanna kiittilla afa katane yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luqa. 10:25-28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa fa baz oocide ooce</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luqa. 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Farisaawuntsi fettilla shiiqii yezin, Yesuusa unttana, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>«Kiristtoosa baz yin waaga7ete? E oode na7a?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Un, «E Dawute na7a» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Yeezin, Dawute Geeshi Ayyaanara maaqqii wayzi Kiristtoosa, ‹Laatstso› ga7i xeege? Dawute ga7itera,<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>«Laatstsii Xoozii, ta Laatstsego,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ta Laatstsego: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yinna besite Dawute ta Laatstso ga7i xeegide Kiristtoosa.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>ne morkkuntsana ne tohita yedhdhize bessi mahode wontsis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">hyanne taappa mizaqi zalar betto»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mizaqi zalar: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adetits wolqqan bonchcho bessi.</char></note>gayda.<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Yikke, Dawute Kiristtoosa Laatstso ga7i xeegiko, wayzi Kiristtoosa Dawute na7a maaqqe?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 22:45">yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Yesuusas fettii qaala mahodes dandda7ide asi ooden baaya. Mahi yinna qammitippa dentsii melle ooce oocodes ooden dandda7ikaaya.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Higge asttamaaruntsin Farisaawuntsi iitatitsito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mar. 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luqa. 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yesuusa shiiqide asuntsisin fa tamaaruntsis hyannii gaar yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>«Higge asttamaaruntsin Farisaawuntsi Muse higge tamaarssodes adetits wolqqara yene. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Yinnii gisho, un yinttana kiittide ubba oochito naagote. Yezin un oochchizanni fana oochchippete. Akkos gayko, un ohizanni fana oochchoos. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Un tookkodes dandda7inttoose toofo accii as toossane. Yezin faas melle atto yezin, ye toofiza asuntsi tookkize wode gil7a bertstsara bochchodes koyoos.<verse eid="MAT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>«Yezin un fa oochito ubba asi be7ade fana oochchane. Fa sintten kushite accize maxaafe xiqise yeze kiitaafe dalggizane, fa afultii macartton pharggizane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yinno un oochchize Xoozis ta ingginttida gaazanno fana beessades (Mahe 15:37-41).</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Mokinttize bessa bonchcho bessin Ayhude woosa keetstsa gaama lo77o oyda kadhane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:1">Maato. 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:8">Mahe 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Faydo 15:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Asuntsi gabe unttana bonchchora saritsizannon ‹Asttamaarzayo› ga7i xeegizanno koyane.<verse eid="MAT 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>«Yezin yin asttamaarize fetto xalaala maaqqide gishon yin ubba ishuntsana maaqqide gisho ‹Asttamaare› ga7intti xeeginttippete. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Yinttis salo fettii aday xalaala yeze gisho hyanne sa7alla ooden ‹Adayo› ga7i xeeginttippete. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Yinttis fettii Laatstsii Kiristtoosa xalaala yeze gisho ‹Laatstso› ga7intti xeeginttippete. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Yin gidda anggistize yinttis aro maaqqe. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Fana dhoqi yiize ooden toochoda; fana toochize ooden dhoqi gawuda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luqa. 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Higge asttamaaruntsin Farisaawuntsi borinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mar. 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luqa. 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>«Yin, cubbuntso, higge asttamaaruntso Farsaawuntso, asunts tiino salo ka7itumo gorddizuntso yinttana bade. Yin, yin ommite geloos mahi melluntsanan geltsoos.<verse eid="MAT 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>[«Yin cubbuntso, higge asttamaaruntson, Farisaawuntso budanuntsi keetsito yin bonqite, asi bo7o ga7i woosa pharggizane. Yinnii gisho yinttana bade. Ubbappa aadhize firdda yinttana naagane.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii zaga maxaafuntsi faydo 14 gujjane.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>«Yin, cubbuntso, higge asttamaaruntso Farsaawuntso, yin fettii asi ammantsodes abbaran sa7aran wutane. Yezin yin eza ammantside wode ye atstsa yinttappa aatsii Gaannames giigize gisho yinttana bade.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>«Ooden Xoozze keetstsara caaqqiko akkon baaya. Yezin Xoozze keetstsa yeze worqqara caaqqiko, yinna caaqita eza gomoda gaaze qooquntso, yinttis qooqii melluntsana kaalitsizuntso, yinttana bade. <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Yin, eeyuntso, qooquntso, worqqa aadhanene? Worqqiza geeshize Xoozze keetsita aadhe? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Mahi ‹Ooden zharsho zharshize besite caaqqiko, akkon baaya. Yezin ooden E kattara yeze zharshite caaqqiko, yinna caaqita eza gomoda› yaga7i tamaarssane. <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Yin, qooquntso, zharshita aadhanene? Zharshito geeshize besita aadhe? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Yinnii gisho, zharsho besite caaqqize atstse, yinna zharsho besiten eella afa yeze ubbanne caaqqane. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Xoozze keetstsa caaqqize atstse, yinna Xoozze keetsiten ize yeze Xoozzella caaqqane. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Salo caaqqize atstse Xoozze araatiten ye araatizella bettide Xoozzella caaqqane.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>«Yin, cubbuntso, higge asttamaaruntson Farsaawuntso, yinttana bade. Yin kartsi gaallappa, nattirappan xalooteppa asraata kessane. Yezin higgite yeze aadhii koshshizuntsana ashshida. Yinnan luule firdda, maarotitsin ubba baza ammanintte. Melluntsanan ashshikaayzara hyantsesana yin oochchodes beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa. 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Maato. 5:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Yinttis qooqii melle asi kaallitsizuntso, yin ushitippa wununo kessii gimale qoodhdhane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Leewe 27:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>«Yin, cubbuntso, higge asttamaaruntso Farsaawuntso, yinttana bade. Yin burccuqosin saanes katta zaltto geeshane. Yezin un ganccite bonqan qiiratitsi kumida. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Naate qooqe Farisaawuzayo, burccuqosin saanes ganccito tiinii geesho. Yinnippa suuba, katta zalttan geeshi maaqqada.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>«Yin, cubbntso, higge asttamaaruntson Farisaawuntso, yinttana bade. Bale zalara bootsi qalame tizhintti lo77i, ganccite meqatsin wooqidebaz kumide booza yin aazane. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Yinnii fana, katta zalara asis lo77o aazane. Yezin yin ganccite cubbon iitatitsi kumida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:3">Hawa. 23:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>«Yin, cubbuntso, higge asttamaaruntson Farisaawuntso, yinttana bade. Yin nabuntsis booza keexxane, mahi xilluntsi boozan loytsane. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>Mahi yin, ‹Nuunii zaga nu adunts wode yeze baz maaqqizako, unttara wolla nabunts suutsito gussaama yeshsha› yagaane. <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Yinnii gisho, yin nabuntsana wodhide as na7untsana maaqqidanno yin yin ommite markkidhane. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Yikke, yin aduntsi aykkidanno yin folote.<verse eid="MAT 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>«Hyantsi shooshuntso, goppi na7untso, yin Gaanname firddappa wayzi attode? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Yinnii gisho, ta ohizanno si7ote; taanii nabuntsana, cincca asuntsanan asttamaaruntsana yinttago kiittoda. Unttappa feta feta yin wodhodan masqalalla afa suxxoda. Bagguntsana Ayhude woosa keetstsa alanggara garafodan katamappa katama bay7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Maato. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luqa. 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Yinnii gisho, xillo Aabeela suutsappa dentsii, Xoozze keetstsappan zharsho bessappa gidite yin wodhide Barakiya na7a Zakkariyaasa wode yellodes hyayqqide xillo as ubba gisho yinttana yelloda. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Taanii yinttis turo ohine; yinttin yin aduntsi oochchide balttis hyanna firddita ubba hyantsi yeletuntsalla yelloda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Medho 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2 Zeena 24:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Yerusalaames yeekkida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luqa. 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>«Yerusalaame, Yerusalaame, nabuntsana wodhizanne! Xoozii neego kiittiduntsana shuchchara dhogizanne! Lukule fa na7untsalla afa qefera hyaphphizanni fana taanii ne asuntsana ta shuphite shiishodes wantsi tohe koydo! Yezin tana ne ixxida. <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Yikke, yin Xoozze keetsita kaysi maaqqada. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Taanii yinttis ohine; ‹Laatstse suntsite ye7ize anjjinttidaya› yin ga7ode wontsis lam7intsa tana bo7oos» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Er. 22:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Xoozze keetsita Wul7inttodanno tiino ohida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar. 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luqa. 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesuusa Xoozze keetstsappa kezii qitizin, E tamaaruntsi eego yi7i, Xoozze keetsi gimbito beezida. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Yesuusa unttago mahi, «Yee! Hyanno ubbanno be7inete? Taanii yinttis turo ohine; shuchchi shuchchalla afa keellinttide fana fettin wul7inttikaayzara attoos» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiinoppa hyanodebaz</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar. 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luqa. 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yesuusa Shamahe Derella afa bettezin, E tamaaruntsi fa xalaala eego yi7i, «Yinna ayde hyanod yezako nuus oho. Mahi ne ye7itisin wode wurssutsitis malla akko? yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>«Yesuusa mahi, Yinttana ooden balitsaame fana naaginttote! <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Akkos gayko, gaama asuntsi ta suntsite, ‹Taanii Kiristtoosa, Xoozii as ashshodes kiittidaya› yagaytira yi7i gaama asi balitsoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Yin olan ola wore si7odes yene. Yinnii gaarize baz hyanodes beezize gisho yirggippete. Yezin wurssutsita hyaga. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Worzha worzhara, fettii ka7itumo melle ka7itumora olinttoda. Nayen sa7a en7e dumma dumma bessa maaqqada. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Yinna ubbanna yelo dha7es zooqe fana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>«Ye wode asuntsi yinttana waayes aatsii inggoda, accodan wodhoda. Ta suntsiti gisho asi ubba yinttana ixxoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Ye wode gaamuntsi ammano ashshoda. Fa gidda fete fetaya aatsii inggoda, fete fetaya ixxoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Maato. 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Mahi gaama worddo nabuntsi denddii gaamuntsana balitsoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Iitatitsi gaanggize gisho gaama asuntsi siiqita toyoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Yezin wurssutsi yellodes genccide atstse attoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>As ubbas markka maaqqade fana Xoozze ka7itumo Wonggele Sa7a ubba ohinttoda. Yinnippa suuba, wurssutsita yo7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Maato. 10:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhabsse tuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar. 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luqa. 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>«Yinnii gisho, nabize Daanela ohide dhabsse tunatitsi geeshi bessa eqqidaya yin bo7oda. Qoppize Yinna waagizako nabbabize qoppo!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:27">Mahe 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:11">12:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Yinnii wode Yihuda sa7a yezuntsi derego woxxo. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Fooqella afa yeze atstse fa keetstsite yeze baz ekkodes keetstsa gelanxi woxxo. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Gade yeze fa ma7o ekkodes suub maaqqippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luqa. 17:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Ye wode wodatsi maachuntsin dhantsize maachuntsis gaama un7intte maaqqada. <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Barggo woy Sambbata yin woxxii dhabizanna maaqqaame fana Xooz woossote. <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Akkos gayko, sa7a medhinttidannippa hyayno yellodes hyanikaayze baz, mahi tiinosin mulo hyanoose madha hyanoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Yinna qammiti faydito hyaatitsikaayzako as maaqqide ooden attoos. Yezin E fa dooride asunts gisho yinna qammiti faydito hyaatitsoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Medho 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Qon. 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>«Ye wode ooden yinttana, ‹Yikke, Kiristtoosa hyanne› woy ‹Sekka yene› yagayko ammanippete. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Akkos gayko, worddo Kiristtoosuntsin worddo nabuntsi denddoda. Unttis dandda7inttiko, melle atto yezin Xoozis doorinttiduntsana balitsodes damma mallan gaama qofize baz oochchoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Qoppote, ta yinttis hyanno tiinii ohine.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>«Yinnii gisho, asunts yinttago, ‹Yikke, Kiristtoosa akko baayze ganas sa7a yene› gayko, ize hyanggippete. Woy yinttago, ‹Yikke, qol7a yene› gayko, unbaz ammanippete. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Akkos gayko, zeelintsi salo zeelinggii, awa kessappa gelo yellodes benttizanni gaar, As Na7a ye7ita yinnii gaar maaqqada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:23-24">Luqa. 17:23-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>«Bawuta yeze bessa ankkuntsii shiiqoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luqa. 17:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>«Ye wode yinna waaye qammitippa suuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">«Iira awa dhumoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">aginan fa foo7ito kayoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">Xoolintton saloppa wodhdhoda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">mahi salo yeze wolqqa buqunttoda. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:10">Er. 2:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Ye wode As Na7a ye7e malla salolla afa benttoda. Sa7a yeze asi ubba yeekkoda. Mahi As Na7ay, wolqqaran damma bonchchora salo dhonne giddara yeezin yin bo7oda. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>E fa kiitanchchuntsana damma fuggize moyzera kiittoda. Un sa7a oyddii zala qitii, hyayga gaxappa seko gaxa yellodes yeze ees doornttiduntsana shiishoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:13">Mahe 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zakka. 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laatstsii yo7ode qamma malla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar. 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luqa. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>«Belese minxappa tamaarote. Iza aaci hyaye kessize wode torchche ukkidanno yin erane. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Yinnii gaaran, yin hyanno ubba be7ize wode furtsa ukkidanno erote. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Taanii yinttis turo ohine; hyanna ubbanna folinttode wontsis, hyanna yeletunts aadhaama. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Salon sa7an aadhoda, yezin ta qaaltta aadhoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5">Medho 6:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laatstsii yo7ode qammito ooden eroos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar. 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luqa. 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>«Yinna qammiton yinna saatto salo yeze ta adayp attin melle salo kiitanchchuntsana maaqqin woy Na7aya maaqqin ooden eroos. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>As Na7a ye7ita, Nohe wode hyanidanni gaar maaqqada. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Ye wode dhabsse hyaatsi yo7odeppa tiino Nohe markkabe gelide qamma yellodes, asuntsi mu7iten uzhite, ekkitera gelitera gam77ida. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Dhabsse hyaatsi yi7i, unttana ubba dhabsode wontsis qoppikaaya. As Na7a ye7itan yinnii fana yi7ada.<verse eid="MAT 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>«Ye wode lam77i asunts gade oochchoda. Unttappa fetay ekkinttoda, hyankkay attoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Lam77i maachuntsi wolla gaaccoda. Unttappa feta ekkinttoda hyankkanna attoda.<verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>«Yikke, yin Laatstse akko qamma yo7od yezako yin eroosse gisho miinggi naagote. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Yezin kayzo qammappa akko saate yo7ode yezako karttii aday erizako, fa keetsita bookinttaame fana barkki naagoda yeshsha. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Yinnii gaaran, As Na7ay yin qoppikaayze saate yo7ode gisho yin giigii yezote.<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iitan lo77o arunts aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luqa. 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>«Yeezin, fa kara asuntsis katstsa koshshize wode inggode fana E laatstsize dooride ammaninttizen wozinara yeze aro oode? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>E fa laatstse kiittidanno oochchizin E laatstse yi7i denggide arize anjjnttida. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Taanii yinttis turo ohine; laatstsii ye ariza fa bazitilla ubba shuumoda. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Yezin ye arize iita maaqqiko, ‹Ta laatstse gam77i yo7oda› yaga7i fa wozintte qoppii, <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>fa lagge oochchizuntsana hyadhdhe aykkiko, matsinttizuntsara muyko uzhiko, <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Ye arize laatstse E qoppikaayze qamman E eroosse saate, <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>yi7i eza gachchoda. E ixiton cubbuntsara mahoda. Yinna besite ees yeefon achchi garccingge maaqqada.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Taphphi wuduruntsi aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>«Ye wode salo ka7itumo fa kuraazito aykkii, machcho ko7odes qitide dhiiratsaya mokkodes kezide taphphi wuduruntsana aazane. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Unttappa ichchinuntsi booza, mahi ichchinuntsi cincca.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:35">Luqa. 12:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Boozuntsi kuraaze aykkida, yezin melle lambba aykkikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Yezin cinccuntsi fa kuraazite melle guja lambba aykkida. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Machchito ekkize gam77in, yentsi wuduruntsi gentto aykkin genttida.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>«Giddii bilahe maaqqize wode ‹Yikke, machchito ekkizay yellida, eza mokkodes kezote› yagaaze damma dentsitsize kiita sinttida.<verse eid="MAT 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>«Ye wode yentsi wuduruntsi ubbuntsi barkki, fa kuraazito giigizida. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Boozuntsi cinccuntsago, ‹Nu xomppita hyayqqodes yiize gisho shagii yin lambbitippa nuus inggoyate› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>«Yezin cinccuntsi unttago mahi, ‹Ade, nuusin yinttisin maaqqize lambba baaya. Yinnii gisho, yinttis hyanggi wonggi ekkote› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Booza wuduruntsi lambba wonggodes qitin, machchito ekkize yi7ida. Giiginttii bettide ichchin wuduruntsi eera wolla zhagana keetstsa muusis gelida; furtsiton gorddii ashshida.<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>«Suubappa hyankko wuduruntsi yi7i, ‹Laatstso, Laatstso, nuus bugoya› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>«Yezin E unttago mahi, ‹Taanii yinttis turo ohine; ta yinttana eroos!›<verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>«Yikke, As Na7a yo7ode qammito woy saatto yin eroosse gisho barkki naagote.<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hyaydzdzii oochchizunts aazize</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luqa. 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>«Salo ka7itumo fa oochchizuntsana xeegii faas yeze baz unttis inggi oge qitodes kezide atstsa aazane. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Unttis ommara ommara un wolqqiti gaar fetays ichchin mekiliite,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mekiliite-fettii mekiliite fettii asi oochchizes E yeze berite kumutsi ingginttize damooze.</char></note> fetays lam77i mekiliite mahi fetays fettii mekiliite inggi fa oge qitida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luqa. 19:11-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Ichchin mekiliite ekkide arize iira hyanggi zal77i, melle ichchin mekiliite tirfizida. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Yinnii gaar, mahi lam77i mekiliite ekkide arize melle lam77i tirfizida. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Yezin fettii mekiliite ekkiday hyanggi, olla bookkii, fa laatstsize birza moogida.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>«Gaama wodeppa suuba yentsi arunts laatstse yi7i, fa miishito unttara bi7ida. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Ichchin mekiliite ekkide arize yi7i, melle ichchin mekiliite ki7i, ‹Ta Laatstso, ne taas ichchin mekiliite inggida. Yezin taanii melle ichchin mekiliite tirfizida› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>E laatstse, ‹Zambbay! Ne lo77on ammantsize aro; ne eerats baza ammaninttida. Taanii nena gaama bazalla afa shuumoda; hyanne gelii ne laatstsera ufaytto› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>«Mahi lam77i mekiliite ekkiday yi7i, ‹Ta Laatstso, ne taas lam77i mekiliite inggida. Yezin taanii melle lam77i mekiliite tirfizida› yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>E laatstse, ‹Zambbay! Ne lo77on ammantsize aro; ne eerats baza ammaninttida. Taanii nena gaama bazalla afa shuumoda; hyanne gelii ne laatstsera ufaytto› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>«Mahi fettii mekiliite ekkiday yi7i, ‹Ta Laatstso, ne budikaayzara maxizan burggikaayzara shiishize iita asi maaqqidanno ta erane. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Yinnii gisho, zhashti ne mekiliitiza sa7a moogida. Ne mekiliitize hyaynishe› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>«E laatstse mahi, ‹Hyay iita azal7a arzayo, taanii budikaayzara maxizannon burggikaayzara shiishize asi maaqqidanno erida. <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Yeezin, ne ta mekiliitiza bankke gaddezako, taanii maaqqize wode ta mekiliitiza tirfera ekkodanno kayda. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Yinnii gisho, mekiliitiza eeppa ekkii, taphphi mekiliite yezes inggote. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Akkos gayko, yeze ubbuntsis gujinttodan gaanggoda. Yezin baayzeppa melle atto yezin, ye ees yezayin ekkinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Hyay maaddoose ariza bale dhuma kessii olote. Ize ees yeefone achchi garccingge maaqqada› yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Maato. 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luqa. 13:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wode wurssutsite hyanode firdda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>«As Na7a, kiitanchcho ubbuntsara, fa bonchchora ye7ize wode E fa bonchcho ka7itumo araatalla bettoda. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Sa7a yeze asi ubba E tiino shiiqoda. Wude aday duruntsana deeshuntsappa shaakkizanni fana E ye asuntsana lam77i bessa shagoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Maato. 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">Maato. 19:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Mahi duruntsana mizaqi zalara deeshuntsana workkita zalara essoda.<verse eid="MAT 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>«Yinnippa suuba, kaatize mizaqi zalara yezuntsago hyannii fana yagawuda: ‹Ta aday anjjiduntso, hyankka yi7i sa7a medhinttize wode yinttis giigide ka7itumtto laattote. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Akkos gayko, taanii naydhdhin muuzida, baridhdhin ushshida, zaqqo as maaqqii yi7in mokkida, <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>kallidhin ma7isida, hyargginttin oocida, acinttin tana oocida› yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>«Yinnippa suuba, xilluntsi mahi, ‹Laatstso, ne naydhdhin ayde bi7i muuzido? Woy ne baridhdhin ayde bi7i ushshido? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Ne zaqqo maaqqii yi7in ayde bi7i mokkido? Woy ne kallidhin ayde mayzido? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Ne hyargginttin woy acinttin neego hyanggi nena ayde oocido?› yagawuda. <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Kaatize mahi, ‹Taanii yinttis turo ohine; yin tana kaallize hyantsi ishuntsappa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishe ga7inttizuntsi eza kaallizuntsana.</char></note> eerizes oochchidanna taas oochchida› yagawuda.<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>«Ye wode workkita zalara yezuntsago, ‹Hyantsi baaddinttiduntso, ta kaleppa hyaakkote. Xalahesin E kiitanchchuntsis giigide medhina tama qitote. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Akkos gayko, naydhdhin tana muuzikaaya; baridhdhin ushshikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Taanii zaqqo maaqqii yi7in tana mokkikaaya, kallidhin mayzikaaya, hyarggin acinttin tana oocikaaya yagawuda.<verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>«Ye wode un, ‹Laatstso, ne naydhdhin woy baridhdhin woy zaqqo maaqqii hyanggin woy kallidhin woy hyarggin woy acinttin bi7i nena ayde maaddanxi ixxido?› yaga7i mahoda.<verse eid="MAT 25:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>«Ye wode kaatize mahi unttago, ‹Taanii yinttis turo ohine; yin tana kaallize hyantsi ubbuntsappa eerizaya maaddanxi ixxiko, tana maaddanxi ixxida› gawuda. <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Yinnii gisho, yentsi asuntsi medhina firddas mahi xilluntsi medhina de7oos qitoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa wodhodes zorinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luqa. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Waha. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesuusa yinna timirttito ubba hyaaside wode fa tamaaruntsago, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>«Lam77i qammappa suuba, Faasika ba7ale bonchchize qamma maaqqizanno yin erane. Yinna qammite As Na7ay masqalalla afa suxunttodes as kushe aadhii inggnttoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Ye wode kahinunts hyalaquntsin cimuntsi, Qayyaafa gaaze kahinunts hyalaqize keetstsa shiiqii,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1">Keze 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>asi erikaayzin Yesuusa aykkii, wodhodes zorinttida. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Yezin un, «Asuntsi gidda kachchi denddaame fana ga7i, Faasika bonchchize qamma maaqqippe» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fettii maachita Yesuusa shitto tizhida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar. 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Waha. 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Yesuusa Bitaaniya katama qursuma hyarggide Simoona kara yene. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Yesuusa leematella yezin fettii maachita albasxiroose bilqqaaxe kumutsi gaama al77o shitto ekkii yi7i Yesuusa ommite gussida. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Yezin Yesuusa tamaaruntsi yinno bi7i zhilidhdhi, «Hyanna shittita hyarii iitizanna akkoso?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luqa. 7:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Hyanna shittita al77o waagas bayzinttii, birtta dahuntsis ingginttodes dandda7inttane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Yesuusa un gaazanno erii, unttago, «Hyanna maachito akkos waytsete? Iza taas lo77o baz oochchida. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Dahuntsi ubba wode yinttara yessada. Yezin taanii yinttara ubba wode yezoos. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Iza hyanna shittito taalla afa gussidanna tana moogodes giigisades.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Mahe 15:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Taanii yinttis turo ohine; sa7a ubba hyay Wonggelize sabbakinttize bessa aban, asuntsi izo ohode gaar iza oochchidanna ohinttoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda Yesuusa aatsii inggodes giiginttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar. 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luqa. 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Ye wode taphpho lam77i Yesuusa tamaaruntsappa fetay, Yesqorootu sa7a Yihuda ga7inttize kahinunts hyalaquntsago, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>hyanggi, «Taanii yinttis Yesuusa aatsii inggiko, yin taas akko inggode?» yaga7i unttana oocida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zakka. 11:12</ref></char></note> Un zorintti hyasttam shuchchi bira santime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bira santtime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akkon laaminttikaayze geeshi bira ga7e.</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hyasttam bira santtime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hyasttam bira santtime Isra7eele sa7a aro wongginttizen bayzinttize waaga.</char></note> inggida. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yihuda Yesuusa aatsii inggodes wottize wode koyane.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Faasika kawuto fa hawaaruntsara muyda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luqa. 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Boora ba7ale bonchchize tiino qamma, Yesuusa tamaaruntsi eego yi7i, «Faasika bonchchize qamma ne ma7ade katstsa nu aba giigisade?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Yesuusa unttago, «katama yeze atstsego hyanggi, ‹Asttamaarize, taas wode yellide gisho ta tamaaruntsara Faasika bonchchize qamma ne kara aatstsoda gayda› yaga7ote» gayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>E tamaaruntsi Yesuusa fana kiittidanni fana oochchii, Faasika ba7ale qamma ma7ade katstsa giigizida.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Sa7ita ugurize wode Yesuusa taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsara katstsa ma7ades bettida. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Un muuzin, Yesuusa unttago, «Taanii yinttis turo ohine; yinttappa fettii atstse tana aatsii inggoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Un gaama tannii, fete fete, «Laatstso, turo tana yessane?» ga7i eza oocida.<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesuusa mahi, «Fa kushito taara wolla gabate dakkizay E tana aatsii inggoda. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>As na7a, Xoozze qaaltte ees xaafinttidanni gaar hyayqqoda. Yezin As na7a aatsii inggize atstsa bade; ye atstse yelinttikaayzara attezako ees lo77o yeshsha» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz. 41:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Eza aatsii inggodes yeze Yihuda mahi, «Asttamaarzayo, ne gaaze tanane?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesuusa mahi, «Ne gayde fana» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laatstse kawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar. 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luqa. 22:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Qoro. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Un muuzin, Yesuusa daabbo boora ekkii Xooz galatida. Ye booriza baxxi fa tamaaruntsis inggi, «Hya7ate, mo7ote, hyanna ta ashito» yagayda. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus eating last supper with disciples" file="LB00320B.TIF" size="span" ref="26:26">Yesuusa wurssutsi kawo fa tamaaruntsara muune </figure><verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Ushiton ekkii, Xooz galatida. Unttis inggi, «Ubbuntsi hyannippa uzhote. <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>Hyanna gaama asunts nagartta atto ga7inttode fana lanttize ta suutsito. Hyanna suutsita Xoozii yinttara gelize kille caaqito. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Yezin taanii yinttis ohine; taanii ta aday ka7itumo kille woyne ushi yinttara ushshade qamma yellodes mahi hyanno woyne ushito uzhoos» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Keze 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31">Er. 31:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Galata mazmure yexxideppa suuba shamahe dere hyanggida.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Phexiroosa kaddodanno tiino ohida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luqa. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Waha. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Ye wode Yesuusa unttago,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">«‹Xoozii yenggizaya guuddoda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">durntsin lalinttoda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 26:31">ga7intti Xoozze qaaltte xaafinttidanni gaar hyayno qamma yin ubbuntsi tana ashshii lalinttoda. <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Yezin taanii hyayqqoppa denddidannippa suuba yinttappa tiinii Galila qitoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zakka. 13:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Phexiroosa mahi, «Un ubbanna nena ashshii kaddikon, taanii nena kaddoos» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Maato. 28:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesuusa Phexiroosago, «Taanii nees turo ohine; hyayno qamma lukule oollodannippa tiino ne tana hyaydzdzii tohe kaddoda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Phexiroosa mahi, «Taanii neera wolla hyayqqep attin nena mulon kaddoos» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Hyankko E tamaaruntsi ubba yinnii fana yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Geetesemaane woossida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar. 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luqa. 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Ye wode, Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsara Geetesemaane gaaze besite hyanggi, unttago, «Taanii gode hyanggi Xooz woossoda, yin hyanne bettote» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Phexiroosan Zabdiyoosa na7untsana lam77untsana faara ekkii hyanggi gaama azzanora un7intte aykkida. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Mahi unttago, «Taanii hyayqos yeltsize un7a un7inttida. Hyanne gam7ote taara miinggi naagote» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Eerats tiino hyanggi sa7a bunqqunttii, «Ta Adayo, dandda7inttize baz maaqqiko hyanna waaye xuu7uto taappa hyaaso. Yezin ne qoftta hyanop attin ta qoftta hyanippe» yaga7i Xooz woossida.<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Yesuusa fa tamaaruntsago maaqqii yi7i un genttezin denggida. Phexiroosago, «Yin fettii saate yezakon taara miinggi naagodes dandda7osa? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Faatana yin gelaame gaar barkki naagoten Xooz woossote. Ayyaana giiginttida, yezin asho labbitsi» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Yesuusa mahi lam7intsa hyanggi, «Ta Adayo, taanii hyanna waaye xuu7uzeppa uzhikaayzara aadhodes dandda7inttoosa maaqqiko ne qoftta hyano» yaga7i Xooz woossida. <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Mahin maaqqii yi7ize wode E tamaaruntsi aafto gentto goozin, woy7ezin denggida.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Mahi unttana ashshii hyanggi, tiino qaaltto mahi hyaydzdzintsa woossida. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Yinnippa suuba, fa tamaaruntsago yi7i, «Hyanno yellodes genttii shemppii yene? Yikke, As na7a, nagaranchchunts kushe aadhii ingginttize saate yellida. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Denddii yedhdhote, tana aatsii inggize hyaynishe yellida» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa fa morkkuntsara aykinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luqa. 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Waha. 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Yesuusa hyaga ohizin, taphpho lam77i tamaaruntsappa fetay, Yihuda yellida. Kahinunts hyalaquntsin gade cimuntsi kiittide gaama asuntsi mashshan gufe aykkii eera wolla yi7ida. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Yesuusa aatsii inggide Yihuda yentsi gaama asuntsago, «Taanii yeerizay yin koyze eza, eza aykkote» yaga7i malla inggi gaddida.<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Iira Yesuusago shiiqii, «Asttamaarzayo, saro nees maaqqe» yaga7i eza yeerida.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesuusa eego, «Ta laggizayo, ne hyanne akkos yi7ido?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woy melle bilitsita ta laggizayo, ne hyanne akko oochche?</char></note> yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Yinnippa suuba, shiiqii, Yesuusa kushera aykkida. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Yesuusara yezuntsappa fetay fa mashito shoddii kahinunts hyalaqize ariza guuddii, E hyayto gachchii olida. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Yezin Yesuusa, «Ne mashito suuba shookite maho. Akkos gayko, mashsha shoddize ubba mashshara hyayqqoda. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Ta, ta Adaya woossizako taphpho lam77i mukulappa aadhize kiitanchchuntsana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii cifiras izippun mukul kiitanchcho yezane.</char></note> dakkodes dandda7oosa nees aazane? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Yeezin, Xoozze qaaltte yinnii gaar hyanodes beezane gaynttidanna wayzi folinttode?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Yinna saate, Yesuusa yentsi shiiqide gaama asuntsago, «Tana faanno mahi aykkodes mashshan gufe aykkii yi7idate? Taanii Xoozze keetstsa qamman awara tamaarsitera yinttara yeze wode tana aykkikaaya. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Yezin hyanna ubba hyanidanna nabuntsi Xoozze qaaltte xaafidanna folinttode fana» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luqa. 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Ye wode E tamaaruntsi ubba eza ashshii lalinttida.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa firdda Shanggo tiino shiiqida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar. 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luqa. 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Waha. 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Yesuusa aykkiduntsi kahinunts hyalaqa Qayyaafago eza kanggida. Ize higge asttamaaruntsin gade cimuntsi shiiqii yene. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Yezin Phexiroosa kahinunts hyalaqize woofa yellodes hyaakora eza kaallane. E folito be7ade wontsis gidda gelii naagizuntsara bettida.<verse eid="MAT 26:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Kahinunts hyalaquntsin shiiqide asunts ubba Yesuusa wodhodes eella afa worddo markka koyda. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Gaamuntsi yi7i eella afa worddo markka markkidhida, yezin akkon denggikaaya. Suubappa lam77i asuntsi yi7i, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>«Hyay atstse, ‹Taanii Xoozze keetsito lalii hyaydzdzii qammara mahi keexxodes ta dandda7ane› gayda» yaga7i un ohida.<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Kahinunts hyalaqize denddii eqqii Yesuusago, «Hyantses nena mootize moottis ne mahizebaz baa?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:62 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Waha. 2:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Yezin Yesuusa si77i gayda. Mahi kahinunts hyalaqize, «Taanii nena de7o Xoozze suntsite aykkane; neenii Xoozze na7a Kiristtoosa maaqqiko nuus oho» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesuusa Mahi, «Neenii ne ommite gayda. Yezin taanii yinttis ohine; yikkeppa suuba, As na7a wolqqaama Xoozze mizaqi zalar bettezin, mahi salo dhonnera ye7izin yin be7ada» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Ye wode kahinunts hyalaqize fa afultto feedhii, «Hyaya bo7ote Xooz cazhida! Nuna melle markka akkos koshshe? E hyatte cazhidanno yin si7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dane. 7:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Yin qoftta akko?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:66 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:15-16">Leewe 24:15-16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Unttin, «Ees hyayqo beezane» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Yeezin, un E sintte cuttii guuddida. Malluntsi eza baqqii, <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>«Kiristtoosa! Nena guuddide oode? Ane nuus tinbbite oho» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:68 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Isa. 50:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa Yesuusa kaddida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar. 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luqa. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Waha. 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Phexiroosa bale bettezin, fettii arta eego yi7i, «Neenin Galila Yesuusara wolla yezaya» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Yezin E un ubbuntsi tiino yinna artigo, «Ne gaazanna akko yezakon ta eroos» yaga7i kaddida.<verse eid="MAT 26:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Mahi hyanggi gase furtsa yellodera melle arta eza bi7i, ize yeze asuntsago, «Hyay atstse Naazirete Yesuusara yene» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Phexiroosa lam7intsa caaqqii, «Taanii ye atstsa eroos!» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Eerats gam7odera, yeyga eqqide asuntsi Phexiroosago yi7i, «Neenii turo unttara wolla yezaya; ne ne ohite erinttane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Yinnippa suuba, Phexiroosa, «Taanii ye atstsa eroos!» yaga7i, fana baadden caaqo aykkida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Ye wode iira lukule oollida. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Yesuusa eego, «Ne lukule oollodeppa tiino tana hyaydzdzii tohe kaddoda» ga7idanno Phexiroosa tiirii, bale kezii iita yeefo yeekkida.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda fana suxxida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-3">Luqa. 23:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Waha. 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Wontta gooda kahinunts hyalaquntsin gade cimuntsi ubbuntsi Yesuusa wodhissades zorinttida. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Un Yesuusa accii kanggi worzha ahize Philaaxoosas aatsii inggida.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Ye wode Yesuusa aytstside Yihuda, Philaaxoosa Yesuusalla afa firddidanno bi7i, azzanii, ye hyasttam biriza kahinunts hyalaquntsisin gade cimuntsis suub mahida. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>«Taanii xillo asi hyayqos aatsii inggi nagara oochchida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Hawa. 1:18-19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Yezin un, «Yinna nu madha baaya ne madha» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Yihuda birto Xoozze keetstsa olii ashshii un kaleppa hyanggi, suxuntti hyayqqida.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Kahinunts hyalaquntsi birto ekkii, «Hyanna birtta suuts bira maaqqide gisho nu Xoozze Keetstsa birara yeltsizanna woga baaya» yagayda. <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Yinnippa suuba, wolla zorintti, bete asi moogodes man gade woonggida. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Yinnii gisho, yinna gadita hyayno yellodes suutsi gade ga7intti xeeginttane.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Nabe Ermmiyasa, «Isra7eele asuntsi ees ciggodes gammatide hyasttam bira ekkida. <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>Laatstse tana kiittidanni fana man gade wonggodes inggida» gaydanna ye wode folinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zakka. 11:12-13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Philaaxoosa tiino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar. 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luqa. 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Waha. 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yesuusa gade ahize Philaaxoosa tiino shiiqin, Philaaxoosa eego, «Ne Ayhude kaato?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesuusa mahi, «Ne gayda» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Kahinunts hyalaquntsin gade cimuntsi eza mootize wode unttis akko mahen inggikaaya.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Ye wode Philaaxoosa Yesuusago, «Hyantses nena mootize mootto ubba si7oso?» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Yesuusa melle attoyzin, fettii qaalan mahanxin, gade ahizay gaama qoppida.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusalla hyayqo firddinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luqa. 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Waha. 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Gade ahize berite berite Faasika Ba7ale bonchchize qamma, asuntsi koyze fettii asi achchappa billize woga yene. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Ye wode fettii Barbbaana gaaze iitatitsara gaama erinttide achi keetstsa yene. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Yinnii gisho, gaama asuntsi shiiqii yezin Philaaxoosa, «Taanii yinttis Barbbaana billonene, woy Yesuusa gaaze Kiristtoosa billone?» yaga7i asuntsana oocida. <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>E yinno gaydanna un qanaatii Yesuusa aatsii inggidanno erize gishos.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Philaaxoosa firdda keetstsa bettezin, E machchita, «Taanii hyayno qamma abukkora E baz gaama waayinttitera aqide gisho ye xillo atstsella akko bazin oochchippe» yaga7i kiittida.<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Yezin kahinunts hyalaquntsin gade cimuntsi Philaaxoosa Barbbaana billii, Yesuusa wodhode fana, asunts eza woossode fana, asuntsana zorii mahida.<verse eid="MAT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Philaaxoosa mahi unttago, «Taanii un lam77untsappa yinttis oona billode fana koyete?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Un, «Barbbaana billode fana koyane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Philaaxoosa, «Yeezin, Yesuusa gaaze Kiristtoosa wayssa?» yaga7i unttana oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Ubbuntsin, «Masqalalla eza suxxo» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Philaaxoosa asuntsago, «Akkos? E akko iita baz oochchido?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Yezin asuntsi tiinostippa aatsii, «Masqalalla suxxo» ga7i uukkida.<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Kachchi dentsitseppa melle akko bazin oochchodes dandda7oosanno Philaaxoosa bi7i, hyaatsi ekkii, «Hyay xillo atstse suutsite ta baaya. Hyanno oochchize yinttana» yaga7i asunts tiino fa kushito mattida.<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Asunts ubbuntsi mahi, «E suutsiti gomtta nunan nu na7untsana yello» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:6">Mahe 21:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Yezin, Philaaxoosa Barbbaana unttis billii, Yesuusa alanggara garafii, masqalalla suxuntti hyayqqode fana unttis aatsii inggida.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wottaddaruntsi Yesuusa miicida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar. 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Waha. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Yinnippa suuba, Philaaxoosa wottaddaruntsi Yesuusa worzhito ahize kara ekkii kanggin, gaama wottaddaruntsi ubba E kale eqqida. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>E afultto gaarii ekkii zoqo afula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:28 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zoqo afula: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zaga wode kaatuntsi kattara ma7ize afula.</char></note> ma7isida. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Mahi anggats barneexa giigizii, E ommite gaddida. E mizaqi kushite shombboqo gufe aytsii, E tiintte bunqqunttii, «Ayhude kaatayo, saro nees maaqqe!» yaga7i, eella afa miicida. <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Eella afa cuttida. Ye shombboqo gufiza ekkii, E ommite guuddida. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Un eella afa miicidannippa suuba zoqo afulza eeppa gaarii ekkii, E afultto eza ma7isida. Masqalalla eza suxxodes ekkii kanggida.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa suxintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:25-43">Luqa. 23:25-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Waha. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Un bale kezii, fettii Simoona gaaze Qereena gade asi denggi, Yesuusa masqala wolqqara toossida. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Golggotta gaaze bessi yellida. «Golggotta» gaazanna «Omma ota» ga7e. <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Ize un cizhera worqqinttide woyne ushi uzho ga7i ees inggida. Yezin E yinno qamasi ekkii, uzhanxi ixxida.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Un masqalalla eza suxxidannippa suuba E afultto shaakkii, ixa olii ekkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz. 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Yinnippa suuba, yeyga bettii eza naagida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz. 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Mahi, «Hyay Ayhude kaati Yesuusa» yagaaze mooto xuufe E omma guro gaddida. <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Yesuusara ye wode lam77i faanuntsana fetaya eeppa mizaqi zalara, hyankkaya eeppa workkita zalara, masqalalla afa suxxida.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Ogera aadhize asuntsi Yesuusa fa ommito en7izitera cazhane, <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>«Xoozze keetstsa lalii hyaydzdzii qamma gidda keexizayo, nena ashsho. Ne Xoozze Na7a maaqqiko, ane masqalappa wodhdho» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Maz. 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Yinnii fana, kahinunts hyalaquntsi, higge asttamaaruntsin gade cimuntsi wolla Yesuusalla afa miicida. Hyannii fana yagayda:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Maato. 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Waha. 2:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>«Melluntsana ashshida, yezin fana ashshodes dandda7ikaaya. E Isra7eele kaati maaqqiko, ane masqalappa hyatte wodhdho, nuunin eza ammanoda. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Xoozalla E ammaninttane, Xoozii eza ashshodes koyko ane ashsho. Akkos gayko, E fana, ‹Taanii Xooz Na7a› gaane» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Mahi melle attoyzin, eera masqalalla afa suxunttide faannuntsin yinnii gaar ga7i eella afa miicida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Maz. 22:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hyayqito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luqa. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Waha. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Izippun saateppa hyanggi, uddufun saate yellodes sa7ita ubba dhumida. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Uddufun saate maaqqize wode Yesuusa, «Elohee, Elohee, laama sabaqitani?» ga7i damma uufo uukkida. «Elohee, Elohee, laama sabaqitani?» gaazanni bilitsita «Ta Xoozzayo, ta Xoozzayo, tana akkos ashshido?» ga7e.<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Ize eqqide asuntsappa fete fete yinno si7i, «Hyay atstse Eeliyaasa xeegane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Maz. 22:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Iira unttappa fetay woxxii hyanggi, ispponjje ekkii, caala woyne ushi kuntsida. Ye shombboqo gufize bertsite gaddii ushshodes E doonttigo shiishida. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Yezin hyankkuntsi, «Naago, Eeliyaasa eza ashshodes ye7odyezako ane be7ada» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz. 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Yesuusa lam7intsa damma uufo uukki, hyayqqida.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Yinna saate Xoozze keetstsa suxunttide magaraajjita wookkappa yeekka yellodes lam77i kezii, feedhinttida. Sa7ita en7ida, lallan za77ida. <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Booza bugunttin geeshi asuntsappa gaamuntsi hyayqoppa denddida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31">Keze 26:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Un boozappa kezii, Yesuusa hyayqoppa denddidannippa suuba geeshi katama qitida; ize un gaama asuntsis benttida.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Mato hyalaqizen eera Yesuusa naagize wottadaruntsi sa7a en7idanno ize hyanidanno bi7ide wode gaama zhashtii «Turo hyay Xoozze Na7a» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Ize gaama maachuntsi, Galilappa dentsii Yesuusa maadditera kaalliduntsi hyaakora eqqii be7ine. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Un gidda Magdela Mayrama,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:56 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Magdela Mayramo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gaazanna Magdela katamappa yi7ide Mayramo ga7inttane.</char></note> Yayqooban Yoosefa intta Mayraman Zabdiyoosa na7unts intta yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luqa. 8:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa moogintto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luqa. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Waha. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Sa7a ugurize wode Yoosefa gaaze fettii dure atstse, Armmatiyasa katamappa yi7ida. E fa ommite Yesuusa kaallize asi. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Yoosefa Philaaxoosago hyanggi, Yesuusa ahito ekkodes woossida. Philaaxoosa ahito Yoosefas ingginttode fana kiittida. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Yesuusa ahito ekkii, kille afulara xaaxida. <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>Faas mooginttodes shuchchappa woocide kille booza E ahito moogida. Mahi yinna booziti doontte damma shuchchi shirii gaddii ashshii qitida. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Magdela Mayramiran hyankko Mayramira yinna booziti tiintte bettida.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Wontta Sambbata qamma, kahinunts hyalaquntsin Farasawuntsi Philaaxoosago yi7i, hyannii gaar yagayda: <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>«Laatstso, hyay worddo ohize faxa yezara, ‹Taanii hyaydzdzii qammappa suuba hyayqoppa denddoda› yagaydanna nuus tiirinttida. <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Yinnii gisho, E moogunttide boozto hyaydzdzii qamma yellodes, mintsii naagode fana kiitto. Yinna yi7anxiko, E tamaaruntsi hyanggi E ahito kaysti dhabsi, ‹Hyayqoppa denddida› yaga7i asuntsis ohiko lam7intsa worddita tiinostippa ubba hyankka iitoda» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Maato. 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:23">17:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:19">20:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar. 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Philaaxoosa unttago, «Yinttis naagizuntsi yene; hyanggi yinttis dandda7inttide fana naagizote» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Yinnii gisho, un hyanggi booztta bochinttaame fana shuchchizella mahitame gaddii wottadaruntsara naagizida.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa hyayqoppa dendde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mar. 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luqa. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Waha. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Sambbata aadhin wogga wode wontta gooda, Magdela Mayramiran hyankko Mayrama Yesuusa moogunttide boozto be7ades hyanggida. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Qoppikaayzin wolqqaama sa7a en7e maaqqida. Laatstse kiitanchcho saloppa wodhdhii booza doontte yeze shuchchito gol7izi kattara bettida. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>E bishshita zeelintsi aazane. E afulttan shachchi fana bootsi. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Naagizuntsi kiitanchchiza bi7i, zhashtii goqii, hyayqqide asi fana yii7ida.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Kiitanchchize maachuntsago, «Yin masqalalla afa suxunttide Yesuusa koyzanno taanii erize gisho zhashtippete. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>E kase ohidanni fana hyayqoppa denddida; hyanne baaya. Hyayga yi7i eza moogide besito bo7ote. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Yin hyatte ellisii hyanggi, E tamaaruntsis, ‹Yesuusa hyayqqoppa denddida. Mahi E yinttappa tiinidhii Galila qitoda; yin eza yeyga be7ada› yaga7i ohote. Taanii yinttis hyanno ohodes yi7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Un zhashtiteran gaama ufayttitera, booziti kaleppa ellisii hyanggi, E tamaaruntsis ohodes woxxida.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Qoppikaayzin Yesuusa unttara yellintti unttago, «Saro yinttis maaqqe» yagayda. Un eego shiiqii, E tohito aykkii ees goynida. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Ye wode Yesuusa unttago, «Zhashtippete; hyanggi ta tamaaruntsi Galila hyanggode gaar unttis ohote. Un ize tana be7ada» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Yentsi maachuntsi hyanggodera, boozto naagize wottaddaruntsappa bagguntsi katama hyanggi, hyanide bazito ubba kahinunts hyalaquntsis ohida. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Kahinunts hyalaquntsin cimuntsi shiiqii zorintti, wottaddaruntsis gaama bira inggi, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>«‹Nu genttezin E tamaaruntsi qamma yi7i, E ahito kaystida› yaga7ote. <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Hyanna ohito gade ahizay si7iko, yinna yin bala baayzanno nu ees ohi ammantsoda. Yinttana akkon yirggizippe» yagayda.<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Wottaddaruntsi birto ekkii, ohidanni gaar oochchida. Hyanna ohita Ayhudunts kale hyayno yellodes ohinttitera yene.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Damma Wonggele kiita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luqa. 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Waha. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Hawa. 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:3-8">1 Qoro. 15:3-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Taphpho fettii tamaaruntsi Yesuusa kiittide Galila yeze derego qitida. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Ize un eza bi7ide wode ees goynida, yezin unttappa fete fete so7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Maato. 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mar. 14:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesuusa unttago shiiqii, «Salon sa7an adetits wolqqa ubba taas ingginttida. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Yikke, yin ubba bessa qitote, Aday, Na7ay, Geeshi ayyaana suntsite as ubba tamaarssi, xammaqi ta kiittidanno ubba naagode fana tamaarssitera tana kaallizuntsana mahote. <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>Taanii yinttana kiittidebaz ubba un naagode fana unttana tamaarssote. Taanii wode wurssutsi yellodes ubba wode yinttara yene» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Hawa. 1:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
